<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Zigua bible version</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBULI YEDI IWANDIKWE NI</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="im">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Matayo ni imwenga mwe vitabu vine mwe Lagano hya dikulavyanya wikazi wa Yesu Kulisito. Chila chimwenga mwe ivyo chetangwa “Injili,” nuko kugamba “Mbuli Yedi.” Vyawandikagwa hadya Yesu abanikaga ni Matayo na Mako na Luka na Yohana. Wawandisi hawamanyize chindedi zuwa idyo Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Matayo, mna vyadahika chipindi cha mihilimo milongo mtandatu AD. Naho, hantu awandikile hahamanyike, mna mafani yawandikagwa uko Palesitina naho mafani hata mo mzi wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwandisi ni Matayo, uyo endaga mchisanya ushulu henati kwitangwa kutenda mwanampina wakwe. Naho kamanyika kwa zina dya Mlawi. Matayo endaga yumwenga mwa wadya wasigilwa mlongo na waidi awandikaga kwa vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Vino vyawoneka pwilili mwe mihilimo 60 ikalanga mawandiko ya Lagano dya kale. Kaunga alagise kugamba Yesu nendile nuyo Masiya, mkombolwa asagulwe ni Chohile uyo alavyagwa mo uwoni. Naho Matayo awandikaga vintu vilozize mo Useuta wa Chohile. Wayahudi nendile wakagoja masiya kutenda seuta wa siasa za chiseuta. Matayo akaulisaga kwa ujihi vikuhigana mwe uzumizi kwa kutambalisa useuta wa Muye wa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Matayo ni kitabu chedi kwa kukongela mwe Lagano hya kwaviya vyose vyalanga Lagano dya kale. Dyalunganya mwe malagano maidi. Wasomile naho nawakafanyanya kugamba Matayo akajeza kutimiliza mliganyo wa vitabu viwandikwe ni Musa, ivyo vyendaga vitabu vishano vya nkongo vya Lagano dya kale. Yesu kalonga ko lugulu (Mat 5-7) yadaha kuliganywa na kulavigwa sigilizi za Chohile kwa Musa (Kumbukumbu ya tolati 19; 3-23; 33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Vimndani</para>
  <para style="io">Matayo kakonga Mbuli Yedi kwa kuwagambila mwe kwelekwa kwa Yesu Kulisito na nkongelo ye ndima yakwe 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Vikaheza Matayo atambalisa indima ya Yesu na mahinyo yalozize mwe 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">Mo udumo Matayo alonga mwalo mjima wa Yesu na ndima yakwe na kubanika na kuyuka kwakwe (26-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kulisito</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 3:23-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Luno ni ludongo lwa lukolo lwa Yesu Kulisito, lukolo lwa Daudi, endaga mlukolo ywa Bulahimu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bulahimu amwelekaga Isaka, Isaka amweleka Yakobo, Yakobo amweleka Yuda na walukolo wakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yuda amwelekaga Pelesi na Zela mami yawo ni Tamali, Pelesi amweleka Hesiloni, Hesiloni amwelekaga Alamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Alamu amwelekaga Aminadabu, Aminadabu amweleka Nashoni, Nashoni amweleka Salimoni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salimoni amwelekaga Boazi, nine nani Lahabu, Boazi amweleka Obedi mami yakwe nani Lutu, Obedi amwelekaga Yese.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Yese awelekaga Seuta Daudi, Daudi amweleka Sulemani, nine nani mkaza Uliya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sulemani amwelekaga Lehoboamu, Lehoboamu amweleka Abiya, Abiya amweleka Asa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa amwelekaga Yehoshafati, Yehoshafati amweleka Yolamu, Yolamu amweleka Uziya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uziya amwelekaga Yosamu, Yosamu amweleka Ahazi, Ahazi amweleka Hezekiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiya amwelekaga Manase, Manase amweleka Amoni, Amoni amweleka Yosiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yosiya amwelekaga Yekoniya na walukolo weyawe.</para>
  <para style="p">Chipindi chiya Wayahudi wasamizizagwa Babeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Umo weze waguhigwe mateka uko Babeli, Yekoniya amwelekaga Shealitieli,</para>
  <para style="q">Shealitieli amweleka Zelubabeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zelubabeli amwelekaga Abihudi, Abihudi amweleka Eliakimu, Eliakimu amweleka Azoli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azoli amwelekaga Sadoki, Sadoki amweleka Akimu, Akimu amweleka Eliudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eliudi amwelekaga Eleazali, Eleazali amweleka Matani, Matani amweleka Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yakobo amwelekaga Yusufu, Yusufu nani mgosi ywa Maliyamu nine dya Yesu akwitangwa Kulisito. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ivyo nakuna vyeleko mlongo na mine, kukongela Bulahimu kubula Daudi, na vyeleko mlongo na mine, kukongela Daudi kubula mo usami kwita Babeli, na vyeleko mlongo na mine, ni kukongela hadya waguhigwe utumwa kubula mwe chipindi cha Kulisito Mkombola.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yesu Kulisito</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 2:1-7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vino nivyo elekagwa Yesu Kulisito, Maliyamu nine dya Yesu nakalombwa ni Yusufu. Mna umo hawenati kusolana, Maliyamu nakawoneka ana nda kwa udahi wa Muye Ukukile. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kwaviya Yusufu nakaoneka ywedi haungile kumjela soni Maliyamu mwa wantu, elo nakaunga amwase chinyele. <verse number="20" style="v" />Umo achei akafanyanya imbuli iyo, mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amlaila mwe sozi amgamba, “Yusufu mwana Daudi, usekogoha kumguha Maliyamu atende mkaziwo, kwaviya kenula nda kwa udahi wa Muye Ukukile. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nefungule mwana ywa chilume, nawe naumwitange Yesu, kwaviya uyo nuyo akunga awakombole wantu wakwe mwa masa yawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ivyo yano yose nayalaila chani uchinte udya ulosi Zumbe alongaga kujinkila kwa muwoni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chigoli nenule nda nakutenda na mwana chilume, naye netangwe Imanueli” nuko kugamba, “Chohile ehamwenga na suwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ivyo Yusufu eze asetuke mwe zintongo, adamanya saviya agambilwe ni mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amguha Maliyamu mkaziwe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mna hagonile naye, kubula Maliyamu efungula mwana chilume, Yusufu amwinka zina dya Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Watalamke kulaila ulailo wa zuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu elekagwa mo mzi wa Beselehemu uko Yudeya, mwe chipindi umo Helode endaga Seuta. Vikaheza, wantu wamanyi wa ntondo weza wakalaila ntendele yo ulailo wa zuwa wa Yelusalemu, <verse number="2" style="v" />niyo wauza, “Ekuhi umwana elekwe, akunga atende Seuta ywa Wayahudi? Chiwona ntondo yakwe umo ikalaila ko ulailo we dizuwa, ivyo chiza kumvikila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Seuta Helode eze eve ayo, engilwa ni chinyulu, hamwenga na chila yumwenga wo mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Awetanga wakulu wa walavyantambiko wose hamwenga na wahinyi wa Sigilizi na kuwauza, “Kulisito Mkombola nelekwe kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Wahitula, Nelekwe mo mzi wa Beselehemu, uko Yudeya. Vino nivyo alongile, muwoni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beselehemu mwe isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q">Weye hwi wa udumo mgati mo ulongozi wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya nalawe chilongozi mwako</para>
  <para style="q">naalongoze wantu wangu wa Izulaeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vikaheza Helode awetanga wamanyi wa ntondo wajeni walaile ko ulailo we dizuwa ko mdugano wa chinyele nakubunkula chipindi cha chindedi chilaile intondo. <verse number="8" style="v" />Niyo awasigila waite Beselehemu kwa sigilizi zino, “Hitani mkalonde vyedi mwana alekwe, aho namumwone, mwize mnigambile, chani nami hamvikile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Weze waheze kumwiva Seuta, watoza sila waita, ntondo nayo waiwonaga ko ulailo we dizuwa yawalongoza hadya eli umwana. <verse number="10" style="v" />Weze waiwone intondo, niyo weleleswa. <verse number="11" style="v" />Wengila mwe nyumba, weze wamwone umwana hamwenga na mamiyakwe Maliyamu, wafika madi kumvikila. Walavya majeleko yawo na kumwinka, zahabu, mavuta ya yombe kulu yakwitangwa manemane na uvumba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Niyo wauya kwe kaya yawo kwa sila ntuhu, kwaviya Chohile awafundaga mwe sozi wasekuya kwa Helode.</para>
  <para style="s">Kunyilikila Misili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Weze wahalawe mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amlaila Yusufu mwe sozi nakumgamba, “Helode namlonde umwana chani amkome. Ivyo halaweni, mguhe umwana hamwenga na mamiyakwe mnyilikile Misili, mwikale uko kubula hadya hunga hugambile uhalawe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ivyo ahalawa, amguha umwana hamwenga na mamiyakwe nechilo na kwita Misili, <verse number="15" style="v" />hantu ekalaga kubula mo kubanika kwa Helode. Vino vyadamanyikaga saviya Zumbe alongaga kujinkila muwoni vilaila chindedi, “Simwitanga Mwanangu kulaila Misili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kukomwa kwa wana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Helode eze abunkule kugamba wajeni walaile ko ulailo we dizuwa wamzunguluka, kengilwa ni maya. Alavya sigilizi za kukoma wana chilume mwe Beselehemu hamwenga na we mjihi wata mihilimo midi na wadodo wawo. Vino vyadamanyikaga kutimilana na viya amanyaga kwa awajeni mwe chipindi che ntondo yalailaga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Naho uwoni wa muwoni Yelemiya wachintaga saviya alongaga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Izwi diivika kulaila uko Lama,</para>
  <para style="q">ndilo ya usungu na malombolezo,</para>
  <para style="q">Laheli akuwaila wanawe,</para>
  <para style="q">haungile kuhembelezwa,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya nendile wabanika.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kulaila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Helode eze abanike mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amwizila Yusufu mwe sozi uko Misili, <verse number="20" style="v" />na kumgamba, “Halawe, mguhe umwana hamwenga na mamiyakwe mfose muye mwe isi ya Izulaeli, kwaviya wadya nawakaunga wamkome umwana wabanika.” <verse number="21" style="v" />Elo Yusufu ahalawa, amguha umwana hamwenga na mamiyakwe, wafosa wauya Izulaeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mna Yusufu eze eve kugamba Alikelayo nendile akalongoza hantu ha tatiyakwe Helode saviya zumbe ywa Yudeya, nakogoha kwita uko. Enkagwa sigilizi mwe sozi, ivyo aita mwe si ya Galilaya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Kaita kwikala mwe mzi ukwitangwa Nazaleti. Ivyo viya wawoni walongaga vilaila, “Netangwe Mntu ywa Nazaleti.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kulonga kwa Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:1-8; Luka 3:1-18; Yohana 1:19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mazuwa ayo Yohana Mta kubatiza alaila kwe nyika ya Yudeya na kukonga kulonga. <verse number="2" style="v" />Agamba, “Kweileni masa yenyu, kwaviya Useuta wa kwembingu wi hajihi!” <verse number="3" style="v" />Yohana nuyo mntu alongagwa ni muwoni Isaya akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q">“Izwi dya mntu aguta kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Malanyani sila ya Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q">chulusani sila zose akunga ajinkile!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suche za Yohana zadamanyagwa kwa mazoya ya ngamiya, mwe chigudi chakwe avalaga msipi udamanywe kwa nchingo. Nkande yakwe nani sije na uchi. <verse number="5" style="v" />Elo wantu kulaila ntendele zose za Yudeya wambasaga Yohana kulaila Yelusalemu na kolongo dyose dyo mto Yolodani. <verse number="6" style="v" />Weze weile amasa yawo, niyo awabatiza mo mto Yolodani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Yohana eze awone Mafalisayo na Masadukayo walozize wakeza chani awabatize, awagamba, “Nyuwe welekwa wa nyoka! Ni yuhi awagambileni mwadaha mwenege nkanto ya Chohile akunga aigale kwenyu? <verse number="8" style="v" />Elo lagisani kwa ntendwa zedi kugamba mweila masa yenyu. <verse number="9" style="v" />Naho msekufanyanya kugamba mwadaha mwegombele mkagamba Bulahimu ni tati yetu. Nawagambilani kugamba Chohile adaha kuguha mayuwe yano nakuyatenda welekwa wa Bulahimu! <verse number="10" style="v" />Hoya imalanywa kale kukanta masina ye miti, chila mti haukweleka matunda yedi naukantwe na kudulwa mo moto. <verse number="11" style="v" />Miye nawabatizani kwa mazi kulagisa kugamba mweila masa, yudya neze umo haheza miye nawabatizeni kwa Muye Ukukile na kwa moto. Ni mkulu kujinka miye, naho sikuwagila kwinula vilatu vyakwe. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ana lungo mo mkono wakwe kuhetela nkande zoseni. Ngano yakwe naike mwe digulu, mna mahofya nayoke mo moto haukusila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ubatizo wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:9-11; Luka 3:21-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chipindi icho Yesu niyo eza kulaila Galilaya kubula mo mto wa Yolodani chani abatizwe ni Yohana. <verse number="14" style="v" />Mna Yohana nakonga amchinde akamgamba, “Miye nuyo hungwa nibatize niweye,” “mna kwiza kwangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mna Yesu amhitula, “Leka vitende ivyo haluse. Mwe isila ino nachidamanye vyoseni viwoneke vyedi kwa Chohile.” Ivyo Yohana azumila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aho Yesu eze abatizwe, afosa mwa mazi. Niyo imbingu yagubuka, na kuwona Muye wa Chohile ukasela saviya suwamanga nakumlangaza. <verse number="17" style="v" />Niyo izwi dyalonga kulaila kwe imbingu, “Yuno nuyo mwanangu akuniwagila hungisa.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kujezwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:12-13; Luka 4:1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu niyo alongozwa ni Muye Ukukile kwe nyika chani ajezwe ni Mwavu. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eze afunge kudya kwa mazuwa milongo mine chilo na msi, Yesu niyo alumwa nisala. <verse number="3" style="v" />Niyo Mwavu ambasa nakumgamba, “Uneva wi mwana Chohile, yahitwile mayuwe yano yatende migate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mna Yesu ahitula, “Mawandiko Yakukile yagamba, ‘Wantu hawakudaha kwikala kwa migate iyodu, mna kwa chila ulosi Chohile akulonga.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Niyo Mwavu amwigala Yesu Yelusalemu, Mzi Ukukile, amwika kulanga ko lunenengwe lwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, <verse number="6" style="v" />nakumgamba, “Uneva chindedi wi Mwana Chohile, kwedule hasi, kwaviya mawandiko yagamba.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Chohile nawasigile wandima wa kwembingu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q">nawakutoze na mikono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">chani usekwekobadisa mwe yuwe iviga vyako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Mna mawandiko Yakukile naho yagamba, ‘Usekumjeza Zumbe Chohile ywako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Niyo Mwavu amguha Yesu, amwigala mwe lugulu lutali vidala nakumlagisa useuta wose we isi na ukulu wakwe. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mwavu agamba, “Vino vyoseni nahwinke uneva unafika madi univikile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu niyo ahitula, Shetani halawe! Mawandiko Yakukile yagamba, Mvikile Zumbe Chohile ywako naho msankanile uyodu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Niyo Mwavu amleka Yesu, wandima wa kwembingu niyo weza kumwambiza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akonga ndima yakwe uko Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:14-15; Luka 4:14-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Yesu eze eve kugamba Yohana Mta kubatiza kajelwa mndani, aita Galilaya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Hekale Nazaleti, mna kaita Kapelinaumu, mzi wi hankanda he diziwa dya Galilaya, mwe si ya Zabuloni na Nafutali. <verse number="14" style="v" />Uwoni wa muwoni Isaya alongaga uchinta.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Isi ya Zabuloni hamwenga ne isi ya Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q">mwe isila ikwita kwe bahali, kwe ntendele ntuhu yo mto Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q">Galilaya, si ya sawo Wayahudi!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Wantu wakwikala mwe chiza</para>
  <para style="q">nawawone ulangazi mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q">Mwe wadya wakwikala mwe isi ya chiza ya file</para>
  <para style="q">ulangazi naulangaze.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kukongela aho Yesu kakonga kulonga ulosi wakwe, “Kweileni masa yenyu, kwaviya Useuta wa kwembingu wi hajihi!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etanga walowa samaki wane</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:16-20; Luka 5:1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Umo Yesu akajinka mnkanda mwe diziwa dya Galilaya, awona walukolo waidi walowa samaki, Simoni akwitangwa Petulo na mlukolo ywakwe akwitangwa Anduleya, wakalowa samaki mwe diziwa na lwavu. <verse number="19" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Nitimilani, naniwahinye mtende walowa wantu.” <verse number="20" style="v" />Aho waleka izinyavu zawo wamtimila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eze ajende jende awawona walukolo watuhu waidi, Yakobo na Yohana, wana wa Zebedayo. Nawe mwe ngalawa na tati yawo Zebedayo, wakasuma nyavu zawo vyedi. Yesu awetanga, <verse number="22" style="v" />aho wayasa ingalawa hamwenga na tati yawo, wamtimila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahinya na kuhonya</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 6:17-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu aita mwe isi yose ya Galilaya, akahinya mwe nyumba ya Chiyahudi ya kuvikila, akalonga Mbuli Yedi yo Useuta wa Chohile, na kuhonya wantu wata manyonje yesimile. <verse number="24" style="v" />Mbuli zakwe zizagala mwe isi yose ya Siliya, ivyo wantu wamwigaila wadya woseni na wakahuma, wa kuhuma manyonje yesimile na masulumizo, wantu wata mpepo, na wata chifutu hamwenga na wantu waholomale. Yesu naye kawahonya woseni. <verse number="25" style="v" />Fyo kulu dimtimila kulaila Galilaya na Dekapoli si ina mizi mlongo, kulaila Yelusalemu, Yudeya hamwenga ne isi mwe ntendele ntuhu yo mto wa Yolodani.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ko lugulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu eze awone fyo dya wantu niyo akwela kwe lugulu, uko niyo ekala hasi. Wanampina wakwe wambasa, <verse number="2" style="v" />niyo akonga kuwahinya.</para>
  <para style="s">Chinyemi cha chindedi</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 6:20-23</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nawajimbikwe wadya wachiwa wa chimuye wakumsinya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q">Useuta wa kwembingu ni wawo!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nawajimbikwe wadya wata chinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya Chohile nawafile mbazi!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Wajimbikwe ni wahoile,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya nawalisi isi!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chinyemi ni kwa wadya wakungisa kudamanya yawoneke yedi kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q">Chohile naweguse!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chinyemi ni kwa wadya wakufila mbazi watuhu,</para>
  <para style="q">Chohile nawajimbike!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chinyemi ni kwa wadya wata moyo ulenguke,</para>
  <para style="q">nawamwone Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chinyemi china waivanyi, kwaviya nawetangwe wana wa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ujimbiko ni kwa wadya wakwihizwa</para>
  <para style="q">kwachausa cha kuwoneka wedi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya useuta kwembingu ni wawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mjimbikwa nyuwe chipindi wantu wakawahulutani na kuwasulumizani na kuwalongani vihiye kwa chausa changu. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mtende na chinyemi na kubweda, kwaviya mwikiwa ntunyo nkulu kwembingu. Vino nivyo wawoni wekalaga umo nyuwe hamwinati kusulumizwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Munyu na Ulangazi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 9:50; Luka 14:34-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nyuwe saviya munyu mwe isi. Mna uneva munyu ukaza ulumunyu lwakwe, naudamanywe vivihi munyu vituhu? Haikuwagila kwa chochose, mna udulwe hasi nakujatwa ni wantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nyuwe mwi ulangazi mwe isi. Mzi mwe lugulu haukwefisa. <verse number="15" style="v" />Naho wantu hawakuwasha taa niyo wazika kwedivungu. Mna wazika mlanga mwe chiya cha kwikiya taa, niyo zalangaza kwa chila yumwenga mwe nyumba. <verse number="16" style="v" />Mwe ivyo, ulangazi wenyu na naulangaze mwa meso ya wantu, chani wawone ntendwa zenyu zedi na kumtunya Tati yenyu ywa kwembingu.</para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya Musa na Mawandiko ya Wawoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Msekufanyanya siza kuhigana na Sigilizi ya Musa na mahinyo ya wawoni. Sizile kuhigana nayo, mna kutenda mahinyo yawo yachinte. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, kubula uhelo we mbingu ne isi, hachihali chidodo hegu hadodo vitendese ha sigilizi nahauswe kubula chila chintu chichinte. <verse number="19" style="v" />Elo, yoyose hekutimila hata umwenga mwe miko ikigwe hata hegu ni mdodo na kuhinya watuhu kudamanya ivyo, natende mdodo mo Useuta wa kwembingu. Vituhu, yoyose akutimila Sigilizi nakuhinya watuhu kudamanya saivyo, natende mkulu mo Uzumbe wa kwembingu. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ivyo, nawagambilani kugamba, namdahe kwingila mo Useuta wa kwembingu uneva du hegu mna kuwoneka wedi kuwajinka wahinyi wa Sigilizi na Mafalisayo mwe kudamanya viya Chohile akunga.</para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo mwe maya</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 12:57-59</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mwiva kugamba aho kale wantu wagambilagwa, ‘Usekukoma, mntu yoyose akudamanya ivyo na akantilwe.’ <verse number="22" style="v" />Mna miye nawagambilani kugamba yoyose akumwihiwa mlukolo ywakwe aungwa akantilwe. Naho, yoyose akumgamba mlukolo ywakwe ‘Weye wi ywa bule!’ Negalwe kwe chitala, naho akumgamba mlukolo ywakwe kugamba wi mchilalu nehose kwigalwa kwe bome hedina uhelo. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ivyo uneva waunga kumlaviza jeleko Chohile mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko niyo wakumbuka kugamba kulemana na mlukolo ywako, <verse number="24" style="v" />asa idilavyo dyako kulongozi kwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, hita mkevane na mlukolo ywako, ukaheza uya ukalavywe idilavyo dyako kwa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Uneva mntu akulaha ivanani hemwinati kabula kwechitala, chani mlahi ywako anasekukwinkiza kwa mkanta, akunga akwinkize kwa mndima mnkondo, nawe naujelwe mndani. <verse number="26" style="v" />Chindedi nakugambila, uko nawikale kubula aho nobinde kuliha maliho ya nkomelezo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo mwe ugonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mwiva kugamba navilongwa, ‘Msekugonya.’ <verse number="28" style="v" />Mna nawagambilani yoyose akumsinya mvyele na kummeila mate kamgonya kale naye mo moyo wakwe. <verse number="29" style="v" />Elo uneva ziso dyako dya kulume dyakuhosa ukole masa, ding'ole udidule! Ni vitana vidala waze hantu ho umwili wako kuleka umwili wako mjima kudulwe kwe dibome hedina uhelo. <verse number="30" style="v" />Uneva mkono wako wakulume wakuhosa ukole masa, ukante uudule! Ni vitana vidala waze hantu he vitago vyako kuleka umwili wako mjima kudulwa mwe dibome hedina uhelo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo mwe Kwasa mvyele</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 19:9; Mako 10:11-12; Luka 16:18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Naho vilongwa, ‘Yoyose akumwasa mkaziwe amwinke mawandiko ya kumwasa.’ <verse number="32" style="v" />Mna nawagambilani kugamba yoyose akumwasa mkaziwe, mna siyo kwachausa cha chilanga, amtenda mkaziwe yudya agonywa uneva ana solwa vituhu. Naho akumsola uyo asigwe naye ni mgonyi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwelisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Naho mwiva kugamba aho kale navilongwa, ‘Msekwelisa udanti, mna mdamanye viya mungile mumdamanyize Zumbe.’ <verse number="34" style="v" />Mna miye nagamba, msekwelisa ng'o, hata kwembingu, kwaviya nicho chigoda cho uzumbe mazuwa yose cha Chohile, <verse number="35" style="v" />hegu mwe isi, kwaviya ni hantu hakwikiya viga vyakwe, hegu mwe Yelusalemu, kwaviya nuwo mzi wa Seuta mkulu. <verse number="36" style="v" />Naho usekwelisa kwa mtwi wako, kwaviya hukudaha kudamanya hata luvili lumwenga lutende lung'aile hegu lutitu. <verse number="37" style="v" />Mna ‘Nivyo’ itende ‘Nivyo’ hegu ‘Bule’ itende ‘Bule.’ Vituhu vikujinka aho vyalawa kwa Mwavu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo mwe kuvuziza</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 6:29-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Mwiva kugamba vilongwa, ‘Ziso kwa ziso, naho zino kwa zino.’ <verse number="39" style="v" />Mna miye nawagambilani, msekuhigana na mntu mwavu, uneva mntu akakuhuta mwe funda ya kulume, mhitwile intuhu nayo. <verse number="40" style="v" />Naho mntu akakwigala kwe chitala kukulaha kwa nkazu yako, mlekeile ne dijoho nadyo. <verse number="41" style="v" />Naho mntu anakunga ujende maili imwenga, jenda naye mbili. <verse number="42" style="v" />Mwinke akukulombeza, naho usekumlemeila akukulombeza.</para>
  <para style="s">Kunga Wankondo</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 6:27-28, 32-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Mwiva kugamba navilongwa, ‘Waunge wambuyazo, wehiwe wankondo wako.’ <verse number="44" style="v" />Mna miye nawagambilani, waungeni wankondo wenyu naho walombezezeni wadya wakuwasulumizani, <verse number="45" style="v" />chani mkatende wana wa Tate ywa kwembingu. Kwaviya alangaziza zuwa dyakwe kwa wantu wavu na wantu wedi, naho anyesa fula kwa wadya wakuwoneka wedi na hewekuwagila. <verse number="46" style="v" />Namwinkigwe jeleko dyani kulaila kwa Chohile uneva mkawaunga wadya wakuwaungani? Hata wachisanya kodi wadamanya saivyo! <verse number="47" style="v" />Naho uneva mwasimwila na walukolo wenyu du, mdamanya vihi vitendese? Hata hewemzumile Chohile wadamanya saivyo! <verse number="48" style="v" />Mwaungwa mchinte, saviya Tati yenyu wa kwembingu achintile!</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kulavya kwa watakunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Msinyise msekudamanya wedi mwa meso ya wantu, chani wawasinyeni, kwaviya mnadamanya ayo hamkuhokela ntunyo kwa Tati yenyu ywa kwembingu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ivyo umo ukenkiza malavyo, usekuvila gunda kwa mntu yoyose saviya wasongaganyi wakulombeza mwe nyumba zo kuvikila na mwe sila, chani watunywe ni wantu. Nawagambilani ichindedi, wahokela kale ntunyo yawo. <verse number="3" style="v" />Mna nyuwe mkalavya malavyo damanyani kwa chinyele, usekuleka mkono wako wa kumoso umanye chiya chikudamanywa ni wa kulume, <verse number="4" style="v" />Chani lavyo dyako ditende dya chinyele. Tati yako, akuwona vikudamanywa chinyele, nakutunye.</para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kumlombeza Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 11:2-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Umo mkamlombeza Chohile, msekutenda saviya wasongaganyi! Waunga kuchimala wakamlombeza Chohile mwe nyumba zo kuvikila na mwe zikaya, chani wawonwe ni chila mntu. Nawagambilani chindedi wahokela kale ntunyo yawo. <verse number="6" style="v" />Mna ukamlombeza Chohile, ingila mwe chumba chako vugala ulwivi, niyo walombeza kwa Tati yako, hekuwoneka. Tati yako naye, akuwona vya chinyele, nakutunye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mkamlombeza Chohile, msekulonga mbuli heziligane, saviya wantu hewemzumile Chohile wakutenda, wakufanyanya chohile wawo naweve kwaviya walombezesa. <verse number="8" style="v" />Msekwikala sa awo. Tati yenyu kavimanya kale viya mkunga umo nyuwe hemnati kumlombeza. <verse number="9" style="v" />Elo msinyise ivyo mkungwa mlonge mkalombeza kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Tati yetu ywa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q">zina dyako Dikukile ditogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Useuta wako na wize,</para>
  <para style="q">hano he isi saviya vi kwembingu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chinke mdyo wetu chikunga dyelo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chilekeile masa yetu,</para>
  <para style="q">saviya chikulekeila masa chidamanyizwe ni watuhu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Usekuchijela mwe majezo,</para>
  <para style="q">mna uchambule na yudya Mwavu.</para>
  <para style="q">Kwaviya uzumbe ni wako na udahi na ukulu mazuwa yoseni.</para>
  <para style="q">Navitende ivyo.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Uneva mkawalekeila wantu watuhu masa yawo wawadamanyize, Tati yenyu ywa kwembingu nawalekeileni seivyo. <verse number="15" style="v" />Mna uneva hamuwalekeile watuhu, Tati yenyu naye hawalekeileni masa yenyu mdamanye.</para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya kufunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Umo mkafunga, msekusinyala izi nyuso zenyu saviya wasongaganyi wakutenda. Waleka viya weli chani wamanyike kugamba wafunga. Nawagambilani, wahokela kale maliho yawo yachintile. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mna weye ukafunga hwi kudya, kuluguta mavuta mo uso naho uchane izi fili zako, <verse number="18" style="v" />chani watuhu wasekumanya kugamba kufunga, Tati yako uyodu, hekuwoneka, namanye. Tati yako, akuwona ukudamanya chinyele, nakutunye.</para>
  <para style="s">Ugoli Kwembingu</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 12:33-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Msekwikiya ugoli hano he isi, ukubalangwa ni sondo na nkanga, wabavi nawo wavuna na kubawa. <verse number="20" style="v" />Mna, ikani ugoli wenyu kwembingu, sondo na nkanga havikudaha kubalanga na wabavi nawo hawakudaha kuvuna na kubawa. <verse number="21" style="v" />Kwaviya moyo wako nawikale hadya ugoli wako wili.</para>
  <para style="s">Ulangazi wa mwili</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 11:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Meso yekala enga taa yo umwili. Uneva meso yako yawona vyedi, umwili wako mjima naulangazwe, <verse number="23" style="v" />mna uneva ameso yako yaiha, umwili wako nawikale mwe chiza. Elo uneva ulangazi wi mwako ni chiza, nakutende na chiza chivivihi!</para>
  <para style="s">Chohile na Ugoli</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 16:13; 12:22-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hahali akudaha kutenda mtumwa ywa mazumbe waidi, namwihiwe yumwenga nakumunga umtuhu, namtunye yumwenga nakubela umtuhu. Hamkudaha kusankanila woseni Chohile hamwenga na ugoli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Vino nivyo vikuleka huwagambilani kugamba msekwogoha mwe mbuli za nkande na vya kunywa vikunga vikaleka mkatenda wajima, hegu mwe suche za mili yenyu. Vino, ujima suwo wedi kujinka nkande? Naho mwili suwo wedi kujinka suche? <verse number="26" style="v" />Kaulani wadege, hawakuhanda mbeyu, kuchisanya nkande nakuika mwe magulu. Mna Tati yenyu ywa kwembingu awasinya! Nyuwe hamwi wedi kujinka wadege? <verse number="27" style="v" />Vino hana yumwenga mgati mwenyu akudaha kujenyeza ujima wakwe hadodo, hegu utali wakwe hadodo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Naho ni mbwani kwevinya mwe suche? Kaulani viya maluwa ya kumbago yakukula, hayakudamanya ndima hegu kwesumila suche. <verse number="29" style="v" />Mna nawagambilani kugamba hata Zumbe Sulemani na ukulu wakwe woseni nahana suche ntana sa luwa dimwenga mwe yano. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ni Chohile akuvisa zani dya kumbago, diya dyelo diyaho naluvi, dyokwa. Hana uchindedi utendese wa kuwavisa nyuwe? Nyuwe wata uzumizi mjeche!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ivyo msekwogoha, mkagamba, ‘Nachidye mbwani? Nachinywe mbwani? Hegu nachivike mbwani?’ <verse number="32" style="v" />Vino nivyo ivintu hewekuzumila wakufanyanya. Tati yenyu ywa kwembingu kavimanya kugamba mwaunga vino vintu vyoseni. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mna kujinka yoseni, mfanyanye Useuta wa Chohile na wedi wakwe, naye nawenkeni vyoseni vituhu. <verse number="34" style="v" />Elo msekusankanila mbuli za luvi, neyevinye yenye. Chila zuwa dina mbuli zakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kukantila watuhu</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 6:37-38, 41-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mse kukantila watuhu, chani Chohile naye asekuwakantilani, <verse number="2" style="v" />Kwaviya sila na mjeseze kukantila watuhu, nizo na mkantilwe. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni mbwani ukusinya kabasi ke mwe ziso dya mlukolo ywako, hwikusinya msomo wi mwe ziso dyako? <verse number="4" style="v" />Wadaha vivihi kulonga kwa mlukolo ywako, ‘Goja nuse kabasi ke mwe ziso dyako,’ weye mwenye una msomo mwe idiziso dyako? <verse number="5" style="v" />Weye msongaganyi! Konga kulavya msomo mwe diziso dyako, naho naudahe kuwona vyedi kulavya kabasi ke mwe ziso dya mlukolo ywako.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Msekwinka makuli vintu vikukile, naho mnase kuzidwila nguluwe salu zenyu za yombe kulu zinase kujatwajatwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Lombeza, uza, Towa hodi</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 11:9-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Lombezani, naywi namhokele, londani, naywi namuwone, towani hodi, naywi namvugwilwe. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mna chila akulombeza nahokele, naho chila yumwenga akulonda nawone, akutowa hodi navugwilwe. <verse number="9" style="v" />Hana yumwenga ywenyu tati ywa mntu akumwinka mwanawe yuwe akamlombeza mgate? <verse number="10" style="v" />Hegu namwike nyoka akamlombeza samaki? <verse number="11" style="v" />Elo uneva nyuwe wavu mmanya kwinka wana wenyu vintu vyedi. Tati yenyu ywa kwembingu hawenkise vintu vyedi kwa wadya wakumlombeza!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Damanyizani watuhu viya mkunga wawadamanyizeni, nyuwe nanywi mwa wadamanyizagwa seivyo, vino nivyo ili Sigilizi ya Musa na mahinyo ya wawoni.</para>
  <para style="s">Sila finyu</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 13:24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ingilani mwe sila sisili, kwaviya sila ya kwe bome hedina uhelo ni zangalamu naho ni mpufu, walozize wagwila isila iyo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Mna sila ikwiza ko ujima ni sisili, naho ni ndala, ni wajeche wakwiigwila.</para>
  <para style="s">Mti na matunda yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 6:43-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mkaulise wawoni wadanti, wamwizilani wekale kwa kuse saviya wavaile suche za ngoto, mna mndani mwawo wekala saviya mauzi. <verse number="16" style="v" />Namuwamanye kwa yadya wakudamanya. Miwa haikudaha kweleka zabibu, naho mibaluti haikulavya tini. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mti wedi weleka matunda yedi, mti wihiye nawo haukudaha kweleka matunda yedi. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mti wedi haukudaha kweleka matunda yehiye, mti wihiye nawo haukudaha kweleka matunda yedi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Chila mti hawikweleka tunda dyedi nausengwe niyo wadulwa ko moto. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ivyo, wawoni wadanti namuwamanye kwa yadya wakudamanya.</para>
  <para style="s">Sakumanyize</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 13:25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Suyo chila yumwenga akunitanga ‘Zumbe, Zumbe’ akunga engile mo Useuta wa kwembingu, mna wadya du wakudamanya viya Tati yangu ywa kwembingu akuwaunga wadamanye. <verse number="22" style="v" />Umo zuwa dya Ukanti dikabula, walozize nawanigambe, ‘Zumbe, Zumbe! Hachilongile ulosi wa Chohile kwa zina dyako, kwa zina dyako chigulusa mpepo na kudamanya mpituko zilozize!’ <verse number="23" style="v" />Aho naniwagambe, ‘Siwamanyizeni. Halaweni hangu, wantu wabanasi nyuwe!’</para>
  <para style="s">Wazesi waidi</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 6:47-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ivyo, yoyose akwiva ulosi wangu uno nakuutimila kekala savya mntu mbala akuzenga nyumba yakwe mwe luwe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Fula inya, mito imela na kubohola, nkung'unto isingisa. Mna nyumba haigwele, kwaviya msingi wakwe uzengwa mwe luwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mna yudya akwiva ulosi wangu niyo hakuutimila kekala saviya mntu mhezi azengile nyumba yakwe mwe msanga. <verse number="27" style="v" />Fula inya, mito imela na kubohola, nkung'unto isingisa inyumba, niyo yagwa. Ukugwa kwakwe ni msindo!”</para>
  <para style="s">Udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu eze aheze kulonga vintu vino, idifyo niyo dyehelwa mwe viya ahinyize. <verse number="29" style="v" />Hekale saviya wahinyi wa Sigilizi, mna, kahinya kwa udahi.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya Mntu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:40-45; Luka 5:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Umo Yesu eze asele kwa kagulu, fyo kulu dimtimila. <verse number="2" style="v" />Niyo eza mntu yumwenga mta matana amfikila madi amgamba, “Zumbe, ukaunga wadaha kunitenda nilenguswe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu achumiza umkono wakwe amdonta. Amgamba, “Naunga lenguswa!” Ahadya mtu uyo ahona matana yakwe. <verse number="4" style="v" />Niyo Yesu amgamba, “Tegeleza! Usekumgambila mntu, mna hita ukelagise kwa mlavyantambiko, chani chila mntu akuwone kugamba kuhona, lavya lavyo diya alagize Musa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mndima ywa Mkulu ywa Chilumi</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 7:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Yesu eze engile Kapelinaumu, mkulu yumwenga ywa Chilumi ambasa na kumlombeza amwabize. <verse number="6" style="v" />Amgamba, “Zumbe, mndima ywangu ni mnyonje kukaya, hakudaha kujenda naho alumiswa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Nanite hamhonye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yudya mkulu ahitula, “Zumbe, bule,” “Miye sikuwagila weye wingile mwe nyumba yangu. Mna lavya ulosi du, mndima ywangu nahone. <verse number="9" style="v" />Miye nami ni mntu nihasi he udahi wa wakulu, naho nina wankondo watuhu wehasi hangu. Nami hamgamba yumwenga, ‘So!’ Eza, naho hamgamba mtuhu, ‘Hita!’ Aita, naho hamgamba mndima ywangu, ‘Damanya vino!’ Adamanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu eze eve ayo, kehelwa nakulonga kwa wantu wakumtimila, “Chindedi nawagambilani, sinati kuwona yoyose mwe Izulaeli mta uzumizi sa uno. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nawagambilani kugamba, walozize naweze kulaila ko ulailo wa zuwa na mwingilo wa zuwa nakwikala hamwenga na Bulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo mwe Useuta wa kwembingu. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mna wadya wakunga watende mo Useuta na wadulwe kuse kwe chiza, uko nawaile na kusiginta meno.” <verse number="13" style="v" />Niyo Yesu amgamba yudya mkulu ywa nkondo, “Hita kaya, navitendeke saviya uzumile kwachausa chako.” Ahadya yudya mndima niyo ahona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wantu walozize</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 1:29-34; Luka 4:38-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu niyo aita kukaya kwa Petulo, uko ambwila nine vyala dya petulo, kagona mo lusazi hakudaha homa. <verse number="15" style="v" />Adonta umkono wakwe, ihoma yamlekela, achimala na kumsankanila. <verse number="16" style="v" />Chisingi chize chingile, wantu wamwigaila Yesu wantu walozize na wata mpepo. Yesu agulusa mpepo zihiye kwa ulosi nakuhonya woseni nawakalumwa. <verse number="17" style="v" />Adamanyaga ivyo kutenda viya alongaga muwoni Isaya vilaile, “Yeye mwenye kaguha ubovu wetu nakuguha manyonje yetu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wakunga watende Wanampina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 9:57-62</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Yesu eze asinye fyo dya wantu dimzunguluka, awaunga wanampina wakwe womboke ntendele ya kaidi ye diziwa. <verse number="19" style="v" />Mhinyi ywa Sigilizi yumwenga ambasa amgamba, “Mhinyi, miye na hutimile uko nawite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yesu amhitula amgamba, “Mauzi yana malundu na wadege wana masasa mlanga mwe miti, mna Mwana ywa Mntu hana heugono na kuhumula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yumwenga mwa wanampina wakwe amgamba, “Zumbe, ndakunileka nuye hamhambe tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu amhitula amgamba, “Nitimila, waleke wabanike wahambe weyawe wabanike.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anyamaza nkung'unto</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 4:35-41; Luka 8:22-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu akwela mwe ngalawa, wanampina wakwe nawo waita naye. <verse number="24" style="v" />Aho wimbi kulu dyatowa idiziwa, ngalawa neimwe nkondo ya kudidimila. Mna Yesu na kagona. <verse number="25" style="v" />Wanampina wambasa wamwinula. Wamgamba, “Zumbe! Chikombole. Chafa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Ni mbwani mkogohesa? Chindedi uzumizi wenyu nimdodo!” Niyo enuka na kukwahila inkung'unto namawimbi vinyamale, niyo kwatenda kwa ziziwalisa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chila yumwenga kehelwa. Wagamba, “Yuno ni mntu ywani? Hata nkungunto na mawimbi vyamwiva!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wantu waidi wata mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 5:1-20; Luka 8:26-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Umo Yesu eze abule mo mzi wa Gadala mwe ntendele ntuhu ye diziwa, adugana na wantu waidi wakulaila kwe zimbila. Wantu wadya wendaga na mpepo nkali zitendese naho nendile hahana mntu ukudaha kugwila isila iyo. <verse number="29" style="v" />Aho waguta, “Wachunga mbwani, weye Mwana Chohile? Kwiza kuchinka nkuto chipindi hachinati kubula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nakuna fyo dya nguluwe dikudya hajihi aho. <verse number="31" style="v" />Ivyo mpepo zamlombeza Yesu, “Uneva waunga uchiguluse, chigale mwe diya idifyo dye zinguluwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Hitani.” Ivyo zafosa nakwingila mwe zinguluwe. Fyo jima dye zinguluwe dyagulukila kwe diziwa nakufila mwa mazi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Wadimi nawakadima izinguluwe niyo waguluka kwita komzi, uko wakusimwila imbuli injima naviya vilaile kwa wadya wantu wata zimpepo. <verse number="34" style="v" />Ivyo chila yumwenga kulaila komzi kaita kumsingila Yesu, weze wamwone, wamlombeza amlawe mo umzi wawo.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mntu aholomale</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 2:1-12; Luka 5:17-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu engila mwe ngalawa, alaila ntendele ya kaidi ye diziwa nakwingila komzi wakwe nakekala. <verse number="2" style="v" />Wantu wamwenga wamwigaila mntu aholomale, agonile mwe lusazi. Yesu eze awone uzumizi wakwe, amgamba yudya aholomale, “Mwanangu kwenke moyo, masa yako yalekeilwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Niyo wahinya Sigilizi wamwenga wawagamba, “Yuno mntu amhuluta Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yesu kuno akamanya viya wakufanyanya mwe myoyo yawo, awagamba, “Ni mbwani mkufanyanya mbuli zihiye sa zino? <verse number="5" style="v" />Vihufu ni vihi, kugamba, ‘Masa yako yalekeilwa,’ hegu kugamba, ‘Chimala ujende’? <verse number="6" style="v" />Ivyo naunga mnamanye kugamba Mwana ywa Mntu ana udahi mwe isi wa kulekeila masa.” Elo amgamba yudya mntu aholomale, “Chimala, guha lusazi lwako wite kaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uyo mntu achimala nakwita kaya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Umo wantu weze waviwone viya vilaile wogoha, na kumtunya Chohile kwa kumwinka udahi kwa wantu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwitanga Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 2:13-17; Luka 5:27-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu ahalawa aho hantu, niyo ajenda jenda, awona mchisanya kodi, akwitangwa Matayo, kekala he ndima yakwe. Amgamba, “Nitimila.”</para>
  <para style="p">Matayo enuka na kumtimila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Umo Yesu akadya nkande kukaya kwa Matayo, wachisanya kodi walozize na wata masa watuhu weza nakulungana na Yesu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe he ndala. <verse number="11" style="v" />Mafalisayo wamwenga waviwona vino nakuwauza wanampina wakwe, “Ni mbwani mhinyi wenyu akudya na wachisanya kodi na wantu wata masa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Yesu kaweva nakuwahitula, “Wantu wajima hawakunga mlaguzi, mna wadya wanyonje awodu. <verse number="13" style="v" />Hitani mkalonde Vikulongwa mwa mawandiko Chohile alongaga. ‘Naunga mbazi, siyo ntambiko ya nyama.’ Miye mwenye sizile kunga wadya wakwefanyanya wawoneka wedi, mna wata masa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuuza mwe kufunga</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 2:18-22; Luka 5:33-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Niyo wanampina wa Yohana Mta kubatiza wambasa Yesu, wakauza, “Ni mbwani suwe chafunga, Mafalisayo nawo wafunga, mna wanampina wako hawakufunga ng'o?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Vino wajeni wagonekwe mwe nyinka wadaha kwikala na usungu umo umwali nauswe? Havikudahika! Mna zuwa dyeza umo nyinka yo umwali nayuswe kwenyu, nawo nawafunge.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hahali akusuma chilaka cha suche mpya mwe suche isakale, kwaviya chihya nachitatule suche isakale na kujela sakaza mwe isuche. <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahali akujela divai mpya mwe vyampa vya mikota visakale, kwaviya mikwiji naitulike, divai naitike, mikwiji naibanike. Mna divai mpya yaikwa mwe vyampa vya mikota vihya, vyoseni navikale mwe hali yedi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana chiche ywa mkulu na mvyele</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 5:21-43; Luka 8:40-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Umo Yesu akalonga vino, mkulu yumwenga wa Chiyahudi ambasa, amfikila madi na kugamba, “Mwanangu wa chiche kabanika. Mna so ujeleke mikono yako mwakwe, natende mjima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu afosa nakumtimila, wanampina wakwe nawo waita hamwenga naye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mvyele nakahuma unyonje wa kulawa sakame kwa mihilimo mlongo na midi kamtimila Yesu hanyuma niyo adonta lepe dye suche ya Yesu. <verse number="21" style="v" />Egamba mwenye, “Uneva du ninadonta isuche yakwe, na nihone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu ahitukila kunyuma niyo amwona yudya mvyele, amgamba, “Kwenke moyo, mwanangu ywa chiche! Uzumizi wako ukuhonya.” Aho yudya mvyele atenda kahona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Niyo Yesu aita kukaya kwa yudya mkulu. Eze awone wantu wakachema nchemo za ndilo kuno fyo dya wantu wakatula lwasu, <verse number="24" style="v" />agamba, “Chila yumwenga afose! Yuno mwana chiche habanike, kata kugona du!” Niyo wose wamseka. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mna wantu weze wafose, Yesu niyo engila mwe chumba nachina umwana uyo, amtoza mkono, umwana naye achimala. <verse number="26" style="v" />Mbuli zo ulosi uno zijenyela mwe isi idya yose.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mantuntu waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Yesu ahalawa hadya hantu, umo akajenda, mantuntu waidi wakonga kumtimila. Waguta, “Mwana ywa Daudi, chifile mbazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu eze abule kukaya, wadya mantuntu waidi wambasa, niyo awauza, “Mwavizumila kugamba nadaha kuwahonya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wahitula, “Zumbe, nivyo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Niyo Yesu adonta ameso yawo na kugamba, “Navilaile, saviya mzumile!” <verse number="30" style="v" />Niyo meso yawo yagubuka. Yesu awasigila kwa nguvu, “Msekwiilonga imbuli ino kwa yoyose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mna wahalawa nakulonga mbuli za Yesu mwe isi idya yose.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya chimumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Umo wantu wakahalawa, wantu wamwenga wamwigaila Yesu chimumu kwaviya nendile ana mpepo. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mna aho mpepo ize iguluswe, uyo mntu akonga kulonga, chila yumwenga kehelwa. Wagamba, “Hachinati kuwona chintu sa chino mwe Izulaeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mna Mafalisayo wagamba, “Mkulu ywa mpepo nuyo akumwinka Yesu udahi wa kugulusa mpepo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu afila mbazi wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Yesu azunguluka kutalamkila mizi na kaya zoseni. Kahinya mwe nyumba zo kuvikila, akalonga Mbuli Yedi yo Useuta, nakuhonya wantu wata manyonje na maine yesimane. <verse number="36" style="v" />Eze awone fyo dya wantu, umoyo wakwe niyo wawafila mbazi, kwaviya wekala wata woga kuno wasokele, saviya ngoto hezina mdimi. <verse number="37" style="v" />Ivyo awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Ulozo uloza, mna wavuni ni wajeche. <verse number="38" style="v" />Mlombezeni Zumbe mta ywa uvuni, egale wandima kuchisanya ulozo wakwe.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Wasigilwa mlongo na waidi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 3:13-19; Luka 6:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu kawetanga wanampina wakwe mlongo na waidi, awenka udahi wakugulusa mpepo nchafu na kuhonya chila unyonje. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mazina yawo wasigilwa mlongo na waidi ni yano, ywa nkongo ni Simoni akwitangwa Petulo, na mlukolo ywa Anduleya, Yakobo mwana ywa Zebedayo, hamwenga na mlukolo ywakwe Yohana, <verse number="3" style="v" />Filipo na Batolomayo, Tomaso na Matayo mchisanya kodi, Yakobo mwana Alifayo, na Tadeyo, <verse number="4" style="v" />Simoni Zelote, na Yuda Isikaliyote yudya amhituke Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asigila ndima kwa Wasigilwa mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 6:7-13; Luka 9:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Yesu kawasigila wasigilwa mlongo na waidi na kuwenka malagizo yano, “Msekwita kwa wantu sawo Wayahudi naho msekwingila mwe mizi ya Wasamaliya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Mna hitani kwe ngoto zagile za nyumba ya Izulaeli. <verse number="7" style="v" />Mo kwita kwenyu mkalonge kugamba. ‘Useuta wa kwembingu wi haguhi!’ <verse number="8" style="v" />Honyani wanyonje, uyusani wabanike, lengusani wata matana, gulusani mpepo. Hamlihile udahi uwo, nyuwe nanywi msekunga chochose. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mwe mikwiji yenyu msekuguha zahabu, hela, hegu matundu ya shaba. <verse number="10" style="v" />Msekuguha mkwiji wa kulombezeza mwe sila, suche ntuhu, vilatu, hegu nkome. Kwaviya mdamanya ndima aungwa ahokele maliho yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mkengila mwe mzi wowose hegu kaya, londani mntu akunga awahokele, ikalani mwakwe kubula aho mkunga mhalaile. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mnengila mwe nyumba walamseni wakaya wa mwe nyumba iyo. <verse number="13" style="v" />Uneva wantu we nyumba idya wakawahokela, watende na utondowazi udya muwaungile, mna wanawalemela, utondowazi wenyu uwawiyeni. <verse number="14" style="v" />Uneva mntu yeyose na alemele kuwahokela, hegu kuwetegeleza, ilaweni nyumba iyo hegu umzi uwo, naho mkungunte iditifili mwe viga vyenyu. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, mwe dizuwa dyo kukantilwa, Chohile na awafile mbazi wantu wa Sodoma na Gomola kujinka wantu wo umzi udya!</para>
  <para style="s">Masulumizo yakwiza</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 13:9-13; Luka 21:12-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kwetegelezeni! Nawasigila saviya ngoto mgati mwe mauzi. Msinyise saviya nyoka, naho mhole saviya suwamanga. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mkaulise! Kwaviya nawawegaleni mwe vitala naho nawahute nkome mwe zinyumba zo kuvikila. <verse number="18" style="v" />Namwigalwe kulongozi kwa wakulu na maseuta kwa chausa changu, chani mlavye ukuzi wa Mbuli Yedi ya Chohile kulongozi kwawo na kulongozi kwa wantu sawo Wayahudi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Umo wanawegalani mwe vitala, msekogoha kugamba namgaze hegu namhitule vivihi, mkabula namwinkigwe yokulonga. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kwaviya sawo nyuwe mkunga mlonge, mna Muye wa Chohile nuwo naulonge kujinkila nyuwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mlukolo namhose mlukolo mnyawe akomwe, tati ya mntu na amhose mwanawe, wana nawawahitukile welesi wawo na kuwakoma. <verse number="22" style="v" />Wantu wose nawawehiweni kwa chausa che dizina dyangu. Mna akunga ajijimize kubula koudumo, nuyo akunga akombolwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Umo wakawasulumiza mwe mzi umwenga, gulukilani mwe mzi mtuhu. Nawagambilani chindedi hambinde kujenda mwe mizi yose ya Izulaeli Mwana ywa Mntu hanati kwiza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mwanampina suyo mkulu kumjinka mhinyi ywakwe, hegu mndima hakumjinka mkulu ywakwe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Vyachinta mwanampina kutenda saviya mhinyi ywakwe, na mndima kutenda saviya mkulu ywakwe. Uneva wamwitanga mta ikaya Belizebuli, ivyo hawawetange awakaya mazina yehiyise!</para>
  <para style="s">Akungwa ogohigwe</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 12:2-7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ivyo, mse kuwogoha wantu awo. Chila chigubikwe nachigubulwe, naho chila chifisigwe nachimanyike. <verse number="27" style="v" />Huwagambilani nyuwe mwe chiza, ilongeni kung'aile, naho mbuli mkuiva ikatakaliswa, ilongeni mwa wantu mlanga mwe nyumba. <verse number="28" style="v" />Mse kuwogoha wadya wakukoma umwili, mna hawakudaha kukoma imyuye. Ywa kogoha ni yudya akudaha kuukoma mwili hamwenga no muye mo umoto we bome hedina uhelo. <verse number="29" style="v" />Wadege waidi watagwa tundu dimwenga. Mna hahali yumwenga mgati mwawo akunga agwe hasi Tati ywawo hevimwagile. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mna kwenyu, hata fili zose mwe mitwi yenyu ziwazwa. <verse number="31" style="v" />Ivyo mse kogoha, nyuwe mwi wedi kujinka wadege walozize!</para>
  <para style="s">Kumzumila na kumlemela Kulisito</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 12:8-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Chila akunizumila mwa meso ya wantu, miye nami nanimzumile mwa meso ya Tati yangu kwembingu. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mna akunilemela mwa wantu, nami nanimlemele mwa meso ya Tati ywangu kwembingu.</para>
  <para style="s">Suwo utondowazi mna sime</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 12:51-53; 14:26-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Mse kufanyanya kugamba siza kwigala utondowazi mwe isi. Sizile kwigala utondowazi mna sime. <verse number="35" style="v" />Siza kulemanya wana na tati ywawo, mwana chiche na nine, mkwelima na mkwewe, <verse number="36" style="v" />mnkondo ywako ni mwelekwa ywako mwenye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Akumuungisa tati yakwe hegu mami yakwe kujinka miye, hakuniwagila. Akumuungisa mwana chilume hegu mwana chiche kujinka miye hakuniwagila, <verse number="38" style="v" />naho hekwinula msalaba wakwe na kunitimila hakuniwagila. <verse number="39" style="v" />Mta kuwona ujima wakwe nawaze, naho yudya akuwaza ujima wakwe kwa chausa changu, nauwone.</para>
  <para style="s">Jeleko</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 9:41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Akuwahokelani nyuwe, anihokela miye, yudya naye akunihokela miye, amhokela yudya anisigile. <verse number="41" style="v" />Akumhokela muwoni kwaviya ni muwoni, na ahokele ntunyo ya muwoni. Akumhokela mta kuwagila kwaviya wawoneka ni wedi, na ahokele ntunyo ya mata kuwagila. <verse number="42" style="v" />Naho uneva yoyose amwinka hata champa cha mazi ye mpeho kwa yumwenga mwe wano wadodo kwaviya ni mwanampina ywangu, nawagambilani chindedi, na ahokele jeleko.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi kulaila kwa Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 7:18-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Umo Yesu eze abinde kuwasingila wanampina wakwe mlongo na waidi, niyo ahalawa, aita kuhinya na kulonga mwe mizi ihaguhi na hadya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Yohana Mta kubatiza umo achei kwe dijeleza eze eve mbuli zose zikudamanywa ni Kulisito, awasigila wanampina wakwe, <verse number="3" style="v" />wakamuze, “Weye ni yudya ukungwa eze, hegu chimgoje mtuhu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yesu ahitula awagamba, “Hitani mkamgambile Yohana yadya yose mkwiva na kuwona. <verse number="5" style="v" />Matuntu wadaha kuwona, waholomale wajenda, wata matana walenguswa, hewe kwiva weva, wabanike wauyuswa naho Mbuli Yedi ya Chohile ya longwa kwa wachiwa. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni chinyemi kwa yudya hena nkama namiye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Niyo wadya weze wahalawe, Yesu akonga kuwagambila wantu mbuli zakwe Yohana, “Mwita kwe nyika kukaula mbwani? Lunyasi lukusingiswa ni mpeho? <verse number="8" style="v" />Mna namfosa kukaula mbwani? Mntu availe suche ntana? Kaula, wantu wakuvala suche ntana we mwe nyumba za maseuta. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mna mwita kusinya mbwani? Muwoni? Ni chindedi, mna yuno nikajinka ya muwoni. <verse number="10" style="v" />Yuno nuyo awandike yano,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Kaula, miye namsigila mndima ywangu</para>
  <para style="q">ho uso wako.</para>
  <para style="q">Naidamanye isila yako yo kukulongwela.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nawagambilani chindedi, mwenyu hanati kwelekwa mwana akutenda mkulu kujinka Yohana Mta kubatiza. Ivyo vili, yudya akutenda mdodo mo Useuta wa kwembingu, ni mkulu kujinka uyo. <verse number="12" style="v" />Kukongela zuwa dya Yohana Mta kubatiza kubula vino haluse Useuta wa kwembingu welavyanya wenye, wantu wakuungisa wauhokela. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kwaviya uwoni uwo walongagwa ni wawoni wose ne Sigilizi ya Musa kubula mwe chipindi cha Yohana, <verse number="14" style="v" />naho uneva mwaunga mzumile ulosi wawo, Yohana nuyo Eliya, ukwiza kwakwe kwawonagwa. <verse number="15" style="v" />Mta magutwi eve!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Haluse nani waliganye na mbwani wantu wa chino cheleko? Waligana na wana wakwikala kwedigwilo, wakuwetanga weyawe, wakagamba, <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Chiwachemelani wila wa nyinka, mna hamvinile! Chichema za ndilo, mna vyose hamwiile!’ <verse number="18" style="v" />Umo Yohana ezile, kafunga kuno hekunywa divai, chila yumwenga kagamba, ‘Ana mpepo!’ <verse number="19" style="v" />Umo Mwana ywa Mntu ezile, adya na kunywa, chila yumwenga agamba, ‘Mkauleni yuno mntu! Nimbafu naho ni mkozi, ni mbuya ywa wachisanya kodi na wata masa!’ Umanyi wa Chohile walagiswa kwa kuwoneka ywedi kwa ntendwa zakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mizi Heikuzumila</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 10:13-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Wantu wa mwe mizi Yesu adamanyaga mpituko na vilagiso vilozize haweile masa yawo, ivyo Yesu kawakwahila wantu we mizi iyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nauluwone, weye mzi wa Kolazoni! Nauvimanye mwenye, Betisaida! Kwaviya mpituko zidamanywe mndani mwenyu zadamanywe uko Tilo na mo mzi wa Sidoni, wekazi wa uko nawavika majuniya na kwekuluguta maivu chikale, kulagisa kugamba weila masa yawo! <verse number="22" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, Chohile nawafilise mbazi wantu wa Tilo na Sidoni kujinka nyuwe mwe dizuwa dyo kukantilwa. <verse number="23" style="v" />Weye nawe Kapelinaumu, Togola! Naukaunga wekweze mwenye kwembingu? Naudulwe hasi kwe bome hedina uhelo! Hegu mpituko zidamanywe kwako zadamanywe uko Sodoma, umzi uwo naucheyaho kubula dyelo. <verse number="24" style="v" />Elo nawagambilani kugamba mwe dizuwa dyo kukantilwa weye naukantilwe kujinka wantu we Isi ya Sodoma!”</para>
  <para style="s">Soni kwangu mhumule</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 10:21-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mwe chipindi icho Yesu ahitula agamba, “Tate, Zumbe ywa kwembingu ne isi! Nakutogola kwaviya mbuli zino kuwafisa wata umanyi na fanyanyi, niyo wawagubwila wana hewena fanyanyi. <verse number="26" style="v" />Heye, Tate, kwaviya nivyo ungile navitendeke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tate kaninka vintu vyose. Hahali ammanyize Mwana, mna ni Tate uyodu, naho hahali ammanyize Tate, mna Mwana uyodu hamwenga na yoyose Mwana akumunga kumgubwila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Soni kwangu, nyuwe nyose msokele kwa kwinula mizigo izamile, naniwahumuzeni. <verse number="29" style="v" />Kwenkeni moyo, mhine kwangu, kwaviya miye sihola, naho nimjijimizi wa moyo, nanywi na mbwede mwe myoyo yenyu. <verse number="30" style="v" />Kwaviya moyo wangu uhuha, na mzigo wangu hunga niwatwiseni uhuha.” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="MAT 11.30">Majeku maidi yatalizwe nila yalime</figure></para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Lufyambo mwe zuwa dya kuhumula</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 2:23-28; Luka 6:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Havikalise umo Yesu akajinka mwe zikonde zuwa dya kuhumula. Wanampina wakwe walumwa ni sala, wakonga kuhulula maiso ya ngano wadya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mafalisayo weze wawone, wamgamba Yesu, “Kaula, wanampina wako wadamanya mbuli hezikungwa mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Hamsomile viya Daudi adamanye, umo endaga hamwenga na weyawe walumwagwa ni sala? <verse number="4" style="v" />Engilaga mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, yeye hamwenga na weyawe niyo wadya imigate aikiwe Chohile, hata hegu havikungwa wowo kuidya, walavyantambiko awodu nawo wakungigwa wadye. <verse number="5" style="v" />Hegu hamsomile mwe Sigilizi Chohile amwinkile Musa, kugamba chila mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula walavyantambiko mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile hawakudamanya viya vikungwa mwe Zuwa dya kuhumula, hawana masa? <verse number="6" style="v" />Nawagambilani, kugamba hano hana chintu chikungiswa kujinka Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile. <verse number="7" style="v" />Uneva hegu mwamanyize ulosi uno, ‘Naunga mbazi, siwo ntambiko,’ hamwawetange wadya hewena masa kugamba wana masa. <verse number="8" style="v" />Kwaviya Mwana Mntu nuyo Zumbe ywa Zuwa dya Kuhumula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mntu aholomale umkono</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 3:1-6; Luka 6:6-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu ahalawa hadya, niyo aita mwe nyumba yo kuvikila, <verse number="10" style="v" />hendaga na mntu aholomale umkono. Nahana wantu wamwenga weyaho wakunga kumlaha Yesu kwa kudamanya vihiye, ivyo wamuza, “Mwe sigilizi yetu ni vyedi kumhonya mntu mwe Zuwa dya Kuhumula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Uneva yumwenga ywenyu ana ngoto ingile mwe bome Zuwa dya Kuhumula, hailavye mwe dibome? <verse number="12" style="v" />Togolani! Mntu ni ywedi kujinka ngoto! Nuko kugamba Sigilizi haikuchunga suwe kumwambiza mntu yoyose mwe zuwa dya kuhumula.” <verse number="13" style="v" />Niyo amgamba yudya mntu, “Chumiza umkono wako.”</para>
  <para style="p">Auchumiza, watenda mjima naho saudya umtuhu. <verse number="14" style="v" />Mna Mafalisayo niyo wafosa wakufunga njama wamkome Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mndima asagulwe ni Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Umo Yesu eze eve injama akufungilwa, akulawa uko, fyo kulu dya wantu dyamtimila. Awahonya woseni nendile ni wanyonje <verse number="16" style="v" />kawalemeza wase kumgambila mntu yoyose izimbuli zakwe. <verse number="17" style="v" />Katenda ivyo chani yadya Chohile alongaga kujinkila kwa muwoni Isaya yachinte.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kaula mndima ywangu nimsagule,</para>
  <para style="q">humungisa, naho nibwedile.</para>
  <para style="q">Nanijele Muye wangu mwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q">naho nalonge na wantu wose we isi kanto dyangu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Halafye hegu kuguta,</para>
  <para style="q">naho hahali akunga eve izwi dyakwe mwe isila.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Havune mwanzi uhindile,</para>
  <para style="q">naho hakome taa ikufifiya.</para>
  <para style="q">Naho abuze vikuwagila vilongoze,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />naho wantu wose we isi nawamwikiye msuhi uyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Beelizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 3:20-30; Luka 11:14-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Niyo wantu wamwenga wamwigaila Yesu mntu mta mpepo, tuntu, naho ni chimumu. Yesu kamhonya, ivyo yudya mntu niyo alonga na kusinya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Wantu woseni wehelwa nakugamba, “Yuno suyo Mwana Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mna Mafalisayo weze weve, wagamba, “Yuno hakulavya mpepo, mna kwa nguvu zikulawana na Belizebuli, mkulu ywa mpepo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Yesu nakamanya viya wakufanyanya, awagamba, “Useuta wowose ukatowana wenye kwa wenye naugwe. Naho wekazi wa mzi wowose hegu wantu wa lukolo lwesimile wakatowana wenye lukolo ulo halwikalise. <verse number="26" style="v" />Ivyo uneva fyo dimwenga dyatowana na tuhu mwe uzumbe wa Shetani, vino ni kugamaba wemalanya kale mwe mafyo naho haukawe kugwa! <verse number="27" style="v" />Nyuwe mwagamba miye nalavya mpepo kwa udahi wa Belizebuli. Ni vyedi, haluse, wadya wakuwatimila nyuwe walavya mpepo kwa udahi wa yuhi? Kwaivyo, nawatende wakanti wenyu. <verse number="28" style="v" />Mna uneva hegu miye nalavya mpepo kwa udahi wa Muye wa Chohile, ivyo Uzumbe wa Chohile uwezilani kale.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hahali akudaha kwingila mwe nyumba ya mntu mta nguvu nakumhoka vintu vyakwe, henati kumtaliza yudya mta izi nguvu, naho na adahe kwinula vintu vya uyo mntu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Yoyose hehamwenga na miye anihiga, yoyose hekunambiza kuchisanya, ichindedi amwaganisa. <verse number="31" style="v" />Ivyo nawagambilani, wantu nawalekeilwe masa yoyose na wihi wowose wakunga wamlongele Chohile. Mna mntu akunga amhulute Muye wa Chohile halekeilwe masa yakwe. <verse number="32" style="v" />Yoyose akulonga dyodyose dya kuhiga Mwana Mntu adaha kulekeilwa masa, mna yoyose akulonga dikumhiga Muye Ukukile halekeilwe masa vino haluse na mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="s">Mti na matunda yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 6:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Chani utende na mti una matunda yedi, utende na mti wedi, mti wedi weleka matunda yedi, mti wamanyika kwa matunda yakwe. <verse number="34" style="v" />Nyuwe nyoka, mwadaha vivihi kulonga mbuli zedi, kuno mwiha? Kwaviya mnomo wa mntu walonga yadya yamemile mo moyo wakwe. <verse number="35" style="v" />Mntu ywedi alavya mbuli zedi zikulawa mwe mpamba ya vintu vyedi, mntu aihiye alavya mbuli zihiye zikulawa mwe hazina ya mbuli zihiye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Nawagambilani, mwe dizuwa dyo kukantilwa chila yumwenga naungwe alonge chila ulosi wihiye alongile. <verse number="37" style="v" />Ulosi wako naukukantile kugamba wi wedi hegu kwiha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuungwa kwa mpituko</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 8:11-12; Luka 11:29-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Niyo wahinya Sigilizi wamwenga na Mafalisayo wamwenga walonga. Wagamba, “Mhinyi, chaunga chiwone mpituko ukudamanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, Wantu wa mazuwa yano wana wihi wi vivihi naho hawammanyize Chohile! Mwanunga mpituko miye? Mpituko iyodu mkunga mlagiswe ni mpituko ya muwoni Yona. <verse number="40" style="v" />Saviya Yona endile mndani mwe inda ya samaki nkulu vidala ekale mazuwa matatu, ivyo nivyo Mwana Mntu nekale mo umoyo we isi mazuwa matatu. <verse number="41" style="v" />Mwe dizuwa dya kukantilwa wantu wa mzi wa Ninawi nawachimale nakuwalaha, kwaviya weila masa yawo umo Yona alongaga, naho nawagambilani hano mna mntu mkulu kumjinka Yona! <verse number="42" style="v" />Mwe dizuwa dya kukantilwa Malikiya ywa Sheba naachimale kuwalahani, kwaviya atambaga ntendele zoseni ze isi yakwe kwetegeleza mahinyo ya umanyi ya Zumbe Sulemani, naho nawagambilani kugamba hano hana chintu chikulu kumjinka Sulemani!</para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kwa Muye wihiye</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 11:24-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Umo mpepo nchafu ikamlawa mntu, yatamba mwe si nkavu ikazungula hantu hakuhemela, uneva haina wone, <verse number="44" style="v" />yegamba yenye, ‘Nanuye kwe nyumba yangu nilaile.’ Akabula ibwila inyumba ibule, ihagilwa, naho ikwa untanda. <verse number="45" style="v" />Niyo yaita kwe kuguha mpepo weyawe watuhu mfungate wadya weihise kuijinka yoyo, zengila na kwikala umo, mntu uyo ivyo neli vyatenda vihise kujinka hadya nkongo. Nivyo navilaile mwe wantu wehiye wa dyelo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nine dya Yesu na Walukolo wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 3:31-35; Luka 8:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Yesu na achei akalonga neidifyo umo mami yakwe na walukolo wakwe nendile wachimala kuse, wakaunga watamwile naye. <verse number="47" style="v" />Mntu yumwenga amgamba, “Kaula, mami yako na walukolo wako wachimala kuse, waunga walonge na weye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Mnala ni yuhi? Na walukolo wangu ni wahi?” <verse number="49" style="v" />Adosa kwa wanampina wakwe, agamba, “Kaulani, wano nawo mnala na walukolo wangu! <verse number="50" style="v" />Yoyose natende saviya Tate kwembingu akunga, uyo nuyo mlukolo ywangu, na lumbu dyangu, na mnala.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mhandi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 4:1-9; Luka 8:4-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mwe dizuwa idyo, Yesu niyo alaila kuse kwe idya nyumba, aita akwikala hankanda hediziwa niyo akonga kuhinya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Wantu niyo wamemelana vidala mo mdugano, akwela mwe ngalawa, ekala, fyo dyachimala mnkanda mwe diziwa. <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu alonga mbuli zilozize kwa miliganyo.</para>
  <para style="p">“Tegelezani, mhandi kaita kwe kuhanda mbeyu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahadya akahanda, mbeyu ntuhu niyo zagwela mwe sila, niyo zadigwa ni wadege. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ntuhu niyo zagwela mwa mayuwe hana ulongo mjeche, aho niyo zahota, kwaviya ulongo nani mjeche, <verse number="6" style="v" />Mna ahadya zuwa dize dyake niyo zahya, kwaviya hazina maizi zinyuluka. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ntuhu niyo zagwela mwe miwa, niyo zahota mna zifintwa ni miwa zinyuluka. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ntuhu zigwela mwe ulongo wedi, zeleka, zimwenga gana, zimwenga milongo mtandatu zimwenga milongo mitatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yesu akomeleza, “Mta magutwi neeve!”</para>
  <para style="s">Vilekile Yesu akahinya kwa miliganyo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 4:10-12; Luka 8:9-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Weza wanampina kwa Yesu, wamuza, “Nimbwani ukulonga kwa miliganyo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, Nyuwe mgubwilwa kumanya chinyele cho Useuta wa kwembingu, mna wowo hawavimanyize. <verse number="12" style="v" />Kwaviya mntu mta chintu nongezezwe, mna mntu hena chintu nahokwe hata chiya ananacho. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nivyo vikuleka nalonga kwa miliganyo kwaviya wasinya, mna hawakwiva hegu kumanya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ulosi uchinta kwawo ulongigwe ni muwoni Isaya ukugamba,</para>
  <para style="q">kwiva namwive, mna hammanye,</para>
  <para style="q">kusinya na msinye, mna hamwone,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kwaviya fanyanyi zawo sizo zedi,</para>
  <para style="q">na magutwi yawo haya kwiva vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q">wafinya ngohe meso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">wanase kusinya na meso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">wakeva na magutwi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">wakamanya mwe myoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">waka kombolwa, niyo Chohile agamba,</para>
  <para style="q">nani wahonye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mna nyuwe mjimbikwa! Meso yenyu yawona, na magutwi yenyu yeva. <verse number="17" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, wawoni walozize na wantu wawoneke wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile nawaungisa wawone yano mkuwona nyuwe, mna hawawone, na kwiva mbuli mkwiva, mna hawevile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mliganyo wa mhandi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 4:13-20; Luka 8:11-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nyuwe tegelezani naho mhine mliganyo wo mhandi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Wadya wakwiva mbuli yo Useuta wa Chohile mna hawakukombaganya vikaheza yudya Mwavu eza na kuzipempula izimbeyu zihandigwe mwe myoyo yawo. <verse number="20" style="v" />Mbeyu zigwele mwe miwa, uyo ni yudya akwetegeleza mbuli, aihokela kwa chinyemi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna haikwika maizi mndani mwakwe, ivyo chipindi chijeche, hadya akulailwa ni masulumizo fanyanyi za mhituka kwa idya imbuli, aho agwa. <verse number="22" style="v" />Idya ihandigwe mwe miwa, uyo ni yudya akwiva mbuli, na mbuli za mwe isi zamfinta, kunga ugoli kwa ifinta idya imbuli, nayo yatenda haikweleka. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mbeyu ihandigwe mwe ulongo wedi, uyo ni yudya akwetegeleza idya imbuli, nakumanya ivyo vikungwa, uyo nuyo akweleka, yuno gana, na yuno milongo mtandatu yuno naye milongo mitatu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wo lugugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Yesu awagambila mliganyo mtuhu, “Useuta wa kwembingu wi savino. Mntu ahandile mbeyu yedi mwe nkonde yakwe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mna nechilo wantu wagonile, eza mnkondo, ahanda ndago mgati mwe ngano niyo ahalawa. <verse number="26" style="v" />Umo indago ne ngano ize ibule haguhi na kweleka, mwa woneka mna ndago. <verse number="27" style="v" />Wandima wakwe wambasa, wamgamba, ‘Zumbe, huhandile mbeyu yedi mwe nkonde yako? Yalawa nahi idya indago?’ <verse number="28" style="v" />Awahitula, ‘Mnkondo nuyo atendile ivyo,’ wandima wamuza, ‘Waunga chite chikaing'ole?’ <verse number="29" style="v" />Awagamba, ‘Bule,’ Mnase kwing'ola indago kwaviya mwadaha mng'ole hamwenga ne ngano. <verse number="30" style="v" />Lekani vikule hamwenga kubula mo kuvuna. Aho naniwagambile wata kuvuna, ‘Kongani kuchisanya indago, mwike machisa mkayoke. Mna ingano ichisanyeni mkaike kwe digulu dyangu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa kabeyu kadodo vidala kakwitangwa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 4:30-32; Luka 13:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Awagambila mliganyo mtuhu. Useuta wa kwembingu wisavino. Mntu yumwenga kaguha mpuluzi ya kabeyu kadodo kakwitangwa haladali niyo akuhanda mwe nkonde yakwe. <verse number="32" style="v" />Ni kadodo kujinka mbeyu zose, mna aho kakukwila katenda mti mkulu kujinka miti yose hata wadege wa koulanga weza wazenga masasa mwa matambi yakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa hamila</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 13:20-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Yesu alonga mliganyo mtuhu, “Useuta wa kwembingu wikala saviya hamila akuguha mvyele, aijela mwe vibaba vitatu vya unga, niyo wagwaduka wose.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajela mliganyo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 4:33-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu kawagambila kwa miliganyo, halongile dyodyose akaleka kujela mliganyo. <verse number="35" style="v" />Katenda ivyo chani ichinte mbuli ilongigwe ni muwoni, akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nanilonge kwa kujela miliganyo,</para>
  <para style="q">nani wagambile yadya yefisigwe kukongela kuumbwa kwe isi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu evilikiza mliganyo wo lugugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Niyo Yesu alaga idifyo, engila mwe nyumba. Wanampina wakwe wamtimila, wamgamba, “Chevilikize umliganyo wo lugugu lwi kwe nkonde.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, agamba, “Mhandi wa ziya izimbeyu zedi ni Mwana ywa Mntu, <verse number="38" style="v" />nkonde ni isi, mbeyu zedi ni wana wa Useuta, idya indago ni wana wa yudya Mwavu, <verse number="39" style="v" />yudya mnkondo ahandile ni Mwavu, ulozo ni udumo we isi na wadya wakuvuna ni wandima wa kwembingu. <verse number="40" style="v" />Saviya ndago ikuchisanywa na kokwa mo moto, nivyo na vilaile mwe dizuwa dyo udumo we isi. <verse number="41" style="v" />Mwana ywa Mntu nawegale wandima wa kwembingu wakwe, nawo nawachisanye kulaila mo Useuta wakwe wantu woseni wakuwakoza masa, na wadya woseni wakudamanya ubanasi. <verse number="42" style="v" />Kuwadula mwe tanuli dyo moto, nuko nakutende na ndilo nakusiginta meno. <verse number="43" style="v" />Naho wadya na wawoneke wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile nawang'ale saviya zuwa mo Useuta wa Tati ywawo. Mta magutwi neeve!</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mpamba yefisize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Useuta wa kwembingu uligana na ugoli ufisigwe mwe nkonde imwenga. Mntu yumwenga eze aubunkule, kaufisa vituhu, kwa chinyemi chikulu niyo aita kutaga vintu vyakwe vyose, na kugula inkonde idya.</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Naho Useuta wa kwembingu uligana mta yombe, akulonda lulu ntana. <verse number="46" style="v" />Hadya akupatila lulu ntana inayombe kulu, aita akutaga vyose ananavyo, na kuigula.</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa lwavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Naho Useuta wa kwembingu uligana na lwavu, luduligwe mwe bahali, lwa chisanya samaki zesimile. <verse number="48" style="v" />Hadya lukumemela lwakweswa kuse, wekalahasi, wachisanya ziya izedi wazijela mwe viya, mna ziya zihiye wazidula. <verse number="49" style="v" />Nivyo navitende mo udumo we isi, wandima wa kwembingu nawalaile nawawapagule waihiye hale na wata kuwoneka wedi, <verse number="50" style="v" />na kuwadula mwe tanuli dyo moto. Nuko nakutende na ndilo na kusiginta meno.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo mahya na ya kale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Yesu niyo awauza, “Myamanya yose ayo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamgamba. “Heye,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Akaheza awagamba, “Elo, chila mhinya wa Sigilizi ahinyigwe mo Useuta wa kwembingu, aligana na mntu mta nyumba akulavya vintu vihya na vyakale hamwenga kulaila mwe mpamba yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alemelwa uko Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 6:1-6; Luka 4:16-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Yesu eze abinde kulonga miliganyo iyo, niyo ahalawa hadya, <verse number="54" style="v" />auya kwe kaya yakwe. Ahinya mwe nyumba yo kuvikila, wantu wose wehelwa niyo wauza, “Yuno kaupatahi umanyi uno na mpituko zino? <verse number="55" style="v" />Yuno suyo yudya mwana ywa msongola? Mami yakwe suyo yudya akwitangwa Maliyamu? Naho walukolo wakwe sawo Yakobo na Yusufu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse number="56" style="v" />Naho walumbu zakwe wose hawahali hano hetu?” <verse number="57" style="v" />Ivyo wamlemela.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu awagamba, “Muwoni atunywa chila hantu, mna siyo mwe isi yakwe, na kukaya kwakwe mwenye.” <verse number="58" style="v" />Kwaviya hawamzumile, hadamanye mpituko zilozize uko.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 6:14-29; Luka 9:7-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mazuwa ayo, Helode Zumbe ywa Galilaya evaga mbuli za Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v" />Awagamba wandima wakwe “Yuno nuyo Yohana Mta kubatiza, kauyuka! Nivyo vikuleka ana udahi uno wa kudamanya mpituko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Helode nakaunga Yohana agwilwe, amtaliza minyolo nakumjela mwe dijeleza. Adamanyaga ivyo kwachausa cha Helodiya, mkaza Filipo mlukolo ywakwe. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kwaviya Yohana Mta kubatiza amgambaga Helode, “Haviwagile weye umsole Helodiya.” <verse number="5" style="v" />Helode nakaunga amkome Yohana, mna na kawogoha Wayahudi, kwaviya nawamwona kugamba ni muwoni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mwe ngasu ya kukumbuka zuwa elekwe Helode, mwana chindele ywa Helodiya avinaga mwa meso ye difyo jima dya wantu. Helode vimwelelesa <verse number="7" style="v" />vilekile alagane kugamba, “Nahwinke chochose naulombeze!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Akalongozwa ni mami yakwe mwe viya akunga amlombeze akagamba, “Ninka vino haluse mtwi wa Yohana Mta kubatiza mwe chihungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Seuta niyo atozwa ni chinyulu, mna kwaviya naka lagana mwa meso ya wajeni wakwe woseni, alagisa viya umndele alombeze enkigwe. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ivyo asigila Yohana amdumulwe umtwi umo emwe dijeleza. <verse number="11" style="v" />Mtwi wegalwa mwe chihungu, enkigwa yudya mndele, amwigaila nine. <verse number="12" style="v" />Wanampina wa Yohana wabula niyo waguha umwili wa Yohana nakuuhamba. Weze wajike waita kumgambila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisa wantu magana milongo mishano</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 6:30-44; Luka 9:10-17; Yohana 6:1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yesu eze eve imbuli iyo, kakulawa uko mwe ngalawa, aita hantu hechedu hehena wantu. Fyo dya wantu weze weve, wamtimila lwaviga kulaila mwe mizi. <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu eze asele mwe ngalawa, awona fyo kulu dya wantu awafila mbazi na kuwahonya wanyonje wawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chisingi chize chingile, wanampina wakwe wambasa, wagamba, “Hano ni holuwala, na saa nayo ijinkisa. Laga idifyo waite kwe zikaya zawo, wakegwile nkande zawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Wasekwita, wenkeni nyuwe nkande.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Wamhitula, “China migate mishano na samaki mbili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Yesu agamba, “Nigailani hano.” <verse number="19" style="v" />Adyunga idifyo dikale mwa mani, aguha idya imigate mishano na ziya izisamaki izimbili. Asinya kulanga kwembingu, ajimbika, aibesula idya migate, awenka wanampina, wanampina wawenka awantu. <verse number="20" style="v" />Chila yumwenga kadya niyo eguta. Niyo walogota vibesu vya migate vigwele hasi, wamemeza ntangulu mlongo na mbili. <verse number="21" style="v" />Wadya wadile na ni wagosi wakubula magana milongo mishano, ukaleka wavyele na wana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda mlanga mwa mazi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 6:45-52; Yohana 6:15-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanampina wakwe wakwele mwe ngalawa wamlongwele waite ntendele ya kaidi yediziwa, kuno akalaga idifyo. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eze abinde kulaga idifyo, akwela kolugulu ichedu, akamlombeze Chohile. Umo chisingi chibwile, Yesu neeyuko ichedu, <verse number="24" style="v" />mwe chipindi chino ingalawa neibula hale mwe isi nkavu, yajubwaniswa na mazi kwaviya nakuna nkungunto nkulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mgati mwe saa chenda na saa mlongo na midi chilochilo Yesu awabasa wanampina akajenda mlanga mwa mazi. <verse number="26" style="v" />Wanampina weze wamwone akajenda mlanga mwa mazi, wengilwa ni nkama, wakagamba, “Ni chizuli!” Niyo waguta kwa nkama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mna aho Yesu awagamba, “Kwenkeni moyo, ni miye. Msekogoha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Petulo ahitula. “Zumbe, uneva chidedi ni weye, nigamba nize kwako hajenda mlanga mwa mazi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “So!” Petulo niyo asela mwe ngalawa, akonga kujenda mlanga mwa mazi ambasa Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mna eze awone idya inkung'unto, ogoha, akonga kudidimila. Aguta akagamba, “Zumbe, nikombola!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aho Yesu achumiza umkono wakwe, amtoza akamgamba, “Weye mta uzumizi mjeche! Nimbwani una nkama?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Weze wakwele mwe ngalawa, nkungunto niyo yatondowala. <verse number="33" style="v" />Wadya wendile mwe ngalawa wamfikila madi Yesu, wakagamba, “Chindedi weye wi mwana Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wanyonje Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 6:53-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Weze wabule ntendele ya kaidi yediziwa, wabula mwe isi ya Genesaleti. <verse number="35" style="v" />Wantu wahadya weze wambunkule kugamba ni Yesu niyo wasigila ulosi kwa wantu we izisi zose zimnkanda. Wantu wamwigaila wanyonje wawo wose, <verse number="36" style="v" />wamwila wadonte hata idilepe dye suche yakwe du, woseni wadontile wahonywa.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya wadalahala</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 7:1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mafalisayo na wahinyi wa Sigilizi walaile Yelusalemu wambasa Yesu nakumuza, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nimbwani wanampina wako wakubalanga miko ya wadalahala? Hawa kuhaka imikono yawo viya vikungwa hewenati kudya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Nimbwani mkuleka sigilizi ya Chohile mkutimila mahinyo yenyu wenye? <verse number="4" style="v" />Kwaviya Chohile agambaga, ‘Mtunye tati yako na mami yako, mntu akunga amligite tati yakwe hegu mami yakwe na akomwe.’ <verse number="5" style="v" />Mna mwahinya kugamba uneva mntu ana chintu chikudaha kumwambiza tati yakwe hegu mami yakwe, mna mwagamba achilavye, ‘Chino ni cha Chohile,’ <verse number="6" style="v" />vyaleka asekumtunya tati yakwe. Mwe vino mwabela sigilizi ya Chohile, vileka mtimile mahinyo yenyu. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Isaya nani mchindedi umo awonaga yedi mwenyu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Chohile agamba, wantu wano wanitunya kwa milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">mna myoyo yawo ihale na miye.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Wanivikila vya bule,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya wahinya mahinyo ya malagiso ya chimntu mntu saviya ni sigilizi zangu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Vintu vikumtenda mntu atende halenguke</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 7:14-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu niyo aditanga idifyo, awagamba, “Tegelezani naho mkombaganye! <verse number="11" style="v" />Chikwingila mwe mnomo wamntu hachikumtenda mzavu, mna chikumlawa nicho chikumtenda mzavu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Niyo wanampina wakwe wambasa, wakagamba, “Kuvimanya kugamba Mafalisayo wehiwa mwe viya ulongile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Chila mti hewihandigwe ni Tati yangu wa kwembingu naung'olwe,” <verse number="14" style="v" />“Walekeni! Awo ni vilongozi mantuntu, tuntu akamlongwela tuntu mnyawe, woseni waidi nawapolomele mwe bome.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Petulo amgamba, “Chilavyanyize umliganyo uwo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Vino nanywi mwichei hamkuvimanya kujinka watuhu. <verse number="17" style="v" />Hamvimanyize? Chikwingila ko mnomo chajinkila kweinda, chafoseza kuse kulaila mo mwili kwita kwe choo. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mna vikulaila mo mnomo vyalaila ko moyo, navyo nivyo vikumtenda mzavu. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kwaviya ko moyo kwalaila fanyanyi zihiye, ukomi na ugonyi na chilanga na ubavi, mbuli za lulimi, na mahuluto. <verse number="20" style="v" />Yano nayo yakumtenda mntu helenguke. Mna kudya hwihakile mikono yako saviya wakulonga mdamanye ivyo, havikumtenda mntu atende mzavu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uzumizi wa Mvyele</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 7:24-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu akulawa uko, aita kwe mkowa hajihi na mizi ya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse number="22" style="v" />Mvyele yumwenga Mkanani na akekala mwe ntendele iyo kambasa. Akang'ung'uzika akagamba, “Zumbe, Mwana ywa Daudi! Nifila mbazi! Mndele ywangu ana mpepo naho ivyo eli sivyo vyedi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mna Yesu hamhitule dyodyose. Wanampina wakwe wambasa, wamlombeza, wakagamba, “Mleke aite! Achitimila naho achitwila lwasu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Sisigilwa kwe ngoto zagile za wantu wa nyumba ya Izulaeli iyodu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mvyele uyo ambwila niyo amfikila madi. Agamba, “Zumbe nambiza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Sivyo vyedi kuguha nkande ya wana niyo waduila mbwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Yudya mvyele ahitula, “Icho ni chindedi Zumbe, mna hata mbwa nazo zadya masigalo yagwele mwe zimeza za maseuta yawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu amhitula, “Wi mvyele mta uzumizi mkulu! Viya ukunga navidamanyike kwako.” Aho mndele ywakwe niyo ahona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wantu walozize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Yesu niyo akulawa uko, abula mnkanda mwe diziwa dya Galilaya. Akwela ko lugulu na kwikala uko. <verse number="30" style="v" />Fyo kulu dya wantu dyambasa, dyamwigaila waholomale, mantuntu, vimumu, na watuhu walozize, wawaika heviga vya Yesu, niyo awahonya. <verse number="31" style="v" />Wantu wehelwa weze wawone vimumu walonga, waholomale wajenda, mantuntu wawona. Naho wamtunya Chohile ywa Izulaeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisa fyo kulu dya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 8:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Yesu niyo awetanga wanampina wakwe, nakuwagamba, “Nawafila mbazi wantu wano, kwaviya watenda na miye kwa mazuwa matatu naho haluse hawana cha kudya. Sikuvyunga waite siwalisize, sima wanagwe mteho mwe sila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Wanampina wamuza, “Nachilavye kuhi nkande ikuchinta kulisa idifyo dino mo uluwala luno?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu auza, “Mna migate mingahi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wahitula, “Mfungate na samaki njeche.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu adyunga idifyo wekale hasi. <verse number="36" style="v" />Niyo aguha idya migate mfungate na ziya zisamaki, amhongeza Chohile, abesula, niyo awenka wanampina, wanampina nawo wawenka awantu. <verse number="37" style="v" />Woseni wadya niyo weguta. Niyo wanampina walogota vibesulo vya migate vigwele hasi wamemeza ngahu mfungate. <verse number="38" style="v" />Wantu wadile wabula magana mlongo milongo mine ya wagosi, ukaleka wavyele na wana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Niyo Yesu alaga idifyo, akwela ingalawa, aita ko mkowa wa Magadani.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kunga mpituko</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 8:11-13; Luka 12:54-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wambasa Yesu waunga wamtoze, nivyo wamlombeza awalagise chilagiso kulanga kugamba kazumilwa ni Chohile. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mna Yesu ahitula, “Dikaswa, mwagamba, ‘Nakutende kwedi kwaviya ulanga winkundu.’ <verse number="3" style="v" />Nomtondo, mwagamba, ‘Dyelo nakutende na fula kwaviya ulanga winkundu naho nimtitu.’ Mwadaha kulongwela viya nakutende kwa kusinya ulanga, mna hamkudaha kubunkula vilagiso vikujenda ne vipindi vino! <verse number="4" style="v" />Wantu wehiye naho hewemmanyize Chohile we vivihi! Mwaunga chilagiso? Chilagiso ichodu mkungwa mwinkwe ukaleka chiya cha Yona.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ivyo awasa niyo aita.</para>
  <para style="s">Ugwadu wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 8:14-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Umo wanampina weze wadeluke ntendele ya kaidi yediziwa, nawajala kuguha nkande yoyose. <verse number="6" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Kaulani, mwedime na ugwadu wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Niyo wakonga kulafya wenye kwa wenye, “Alonga vino kwaviya hachigale mgate wowose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yesu niyo abunkula viya nawakalafya, ivyo awauza, “Nimbwani mkulafya wenye kwa wenye mwe mbuli ya kuswesa mgate wowose? Uzumizi mjeche wi vivihi mnanawo! <verse number="9" style="v" />Mchei kumanya? Hamkukumbuka viya nabesulaga imigate imishano kwa wantu magana milongo mishano? Nammemeza ntangulu nyingahi mlogote? <verse number="10" style="v" />Naho idya imigate mfungate kwa wantu magana milongomine? Ni ngahu nyingahi mmemeze? <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimbwani hamkukombaganya kugamba siwagambilani kwa chausa cha migate? Mwedime na ugwadu wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Naho wabunkwile kugamba hawagambile wedime na ugwadu wa kudamanyiza migate, mna mahinyo ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amlonga Yesu kugamba nuyo Kulisito</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 8:27-30; Luka 9:18-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yesu aitaga kwe mkowa wi hajihi na mzi wa Kaisaliya Filipi, uko awauzize wanampina wakwe akagamba, “Wantu wamtamwila vivihi Mwana ywa Mntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Wagamba, “Watuhu wamgamba ni Yohana Mta kubatiza, watuhu Eliya, watuhu Yelemiya hegu yumwenga ywa wawoni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Auza, “Nyuwe mwanigamba ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Simoni Petulo ahitula, “Weye wi Kulisito, Mwana ywa Chohile mta ujima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Chinyemi chako weye Simoni mwana ywa Yona, kwaviya ichindedi chino hachizile kwako kulaila kwa mntu yoyose, mna kuchinkwa ni Tate ywa kwembingu. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ivyo nakugambila, Petulo, wi luwe, naho mlanga mo luwe luno nanizenge nyumba ya kuvikila, hata bome hedina uhelo hadidahe. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nahwinke nkomwelo yo Useuta wa kwembingu, icho nauvugale mwe isi nachivugalwe kwe mbingu, icho nouvugule mwe isi nachivugulwe kwembingu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Niyo Yesu awalemeza wanampina wakwe wase kumgambila mntu yoyose kugamba nuyo Kulisito Mkombola.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alotela file yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 8:31-9:1; Luka 9:22-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kukongela aho na kujendeleza Yesu kakonga kulonga pwilili kwa wanampina wakwe, akagamba “Naungwa nite Yelusalemu hasulumizizwe ni wadalahala, wakulu wa walavyantambiko, na wahinya Sigilizi. Nanikomwe, mna mazuwa matatu yakutimila naniuyuke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Petulo amguha hankanda, akonga kumkwahila. Agamba “Bule, Zumbe, ivyo havikulaile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu ahituka na kumgamba Petulo, “Uya kunyuma kwangu, Shetani! Wi chifingo kwangu, kwaviya hukufanyanya ya Chohile, mna ya wantu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Niyo Yesu awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Mntu yoyose akunga anitimile, ne elemele mwenye, etwike msalaba wakwe, anitimile. <verse number="25" style="v" />Kwaviya mntu akunga kwambula untu wakwe, na awaze, na mntu akunga aze ujima wakwe kwa chausa changu, nauwone. <verse number="26" style="v" />Mntu na ahokele chibwani akapata isi yose, na kwaza ujima wakwe? Hegu mntu nalavye mbwani akaleka ujima wakwe? <verse number="27" style="v" />Kwaviya Mwana ywa Mntu neze no ukulu wa Tati yakwe hamwenga na wandima wa kwembingu wakwe naho namlihe chila mntu kulawana na viya atendile. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, hana wantu mgati mwa wano wachimale hano, hawabanike, kubula wamwone Mwana ywa Mntu akeza no Uzumbe.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kuhituka isula</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 9:2-13; Luka 9:28-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mtandatu, Yesu awaguhaga Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana mlukolo ywa Yakobo aita nawo kolugulu lutali hantu nawechedu. <verse number="2" style="v" />Uko kahitukila isula yakwe mwa meso yawo, uso wakwe ung'ala saviya zuwa, suche zakwe zing'ala saviya ulangazi. <verse number="3" style="v" />Niyo wanampina watatu wamwona Musa na Eliya wakatamwila na Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Petulo amgamba Yesu, “Zumbe, ni vitana suwe chikatenda hano. Ukaunga, nanizenge mahema matatu, dyako, dya Musa, na idimwenga dya Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Umo achei akalonga, ingu ding'aile dyawagubika, izwi dyalawa mdya mwe diya idingu, dyagamba, “Yuno nuyo Mwanangu akuniwagia hungisa. Mwetegelezeni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Wanampina weze weve diya idizwi, niyo wagwa chifudifudi, wogohesa. <verse number="7" style="v" />Yesu eza, awadonta, awagamba, “Inukani, msekogoha.” <verse number="8" style="v" />Weze wagubule ameso yawo, hawawone mntu mna Yesu ichedu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Umo wakasela kulaila kolugulu, Yesu awasigila, agamba, “Msekumgambila mntu yoyose imbuli muwone, kubula aho akwizila Mwana ywa Mntu, hadya nauyukile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Wanampina wamuza, wagamba, “Nimbwani wahinya Sigilizi walonga kugamba, Eliya nuyo wa nkongo kwiza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Chindedi Eliya nuyo wa nkongo kwiza, uyo naike vyedi chila chintu. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mna nawagambilani kugamba, Eliya keza kale, hawambunkule, wamdamanya yadya yoseni waungile. Mwe ivyo Mwana ywa Mntu nawamdamanya vihiye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Niyo wanampina wabunkula kugamba nakalonga nawo mbuli za Yohana Mta kubatiza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mbwanga mta mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 9:14-29; Luka 9:37-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Weze wabule he idifyo, mntu yumwenga amsogeila Yesu nakumfikila madi. <verse number="15" style="v" />Agamba “Zumbe, mfile mbazi mwanangu wa chilume! Agwa msango naho asulumizwa vihiye vikuleka nkanana zilozize agwela mwe moto hegu mwe mazi. <verse number="16" style="v" />Namwigalaga kwa wanampina wako, mna wadunduga kumhonya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Nyuwe cheleko hemkuzumila naho hemwimanyize! Nanikale na nyuwe vibule ini? Nigailani umbwanga uyo.” <verse number="18" style="v" />Yesu aikwahila idya impepo, nayo yamlawa yudya mbwanga, kukongela aho kahona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Niyo wanampina wambasa Yesu kwa hankanda echedu, wamuza, “Nimbwani suwe chidunduga kuilavya idya impepo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Kwaviya mhungukilwa nu uzumizi. Nawagambilani chindedi, uneva mnatenda na uzumizi mdodo saviya mpuluzi ikwitangwa haladali, mwadaha kulugamba ulugulu luno, ‘Halawe hano wite kudya!’ Nalo na luhalawe. Hakutendeke na mbuli haikudahika mwenyu.” <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna kwa malombezo na kufunga nuko kukudaha kudamanya vino, hachihali chituhu chikuvidaha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga vituhu ifile yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 9:30-32; Luka 9:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Umo wanampina weze wadugane wose uko Galilaya, Yesu awagamba, “Mwana ywa Mntu ehajihi nakwinkizwa mwe mikono ya wantu. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nawamkome, mna mazuwa matatu yakutimila na uyuke.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wanampina wengilwa ni chinyulu vidala.</para>
  <para style="s">Maliho ya kodi ya Nyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Umo Yesu na wanampina wakwe weze wabule Kapelinaumu, wachisanya kodi ya nyumba nkulu ya Chohile wambasa Petulo nakumuza, “Togola! Mhinyi ywenyu alavya kodi ya Nyumba ya Chohile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Petulo ahitula, “Chindedi, alavya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo eze engile kwe nyumba, Yesu akonga kulonga, agamba, “Wagaze, Simoni? Ni yuhi akuliha makanto hegu kodi kwa maseuta we isi ino? Wakaya we isi hegu wajeni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Petulo ahitula, “Wajeni.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ahitula, ni vyedi, “Nikugamba wakaya hawakuliha kodi. <verse number="27" style="v" />Mna sivyo vyedi kuwaihiza wantu wano. Elo hitani kwe diziwa mkadule ndwano mwa mazi. Samaki ya nkongo no gwize, ugubule mlomo wakwe, na ubwile tundu dya hela dikuchinta kulihila kodi yetu suwe waidi.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Niyuhi Umkulu vitendese?</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 9:33-37; Luka 9:46-48</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chipindi icho wanampina wambasa Yesu wamuza, “Niyuhi mkulu atendese mo Useuta wa kwembingu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu etanga mwana, amchimalisa mwameso yao, <verse number="3" style="v" />nakugamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, uneva hamnahituke na kutenda saviya wana, hamwingile mo Useuta wa kwembingu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Akulise mo Useuta wa kwembingu ni yudya akweseleza niyo ekala saviya yuno mwana. <verse number="5" style="v" />Naho mntu yoyose akumhokela mwana yumwenga sa yuno kwa zina dyangu, anihokela miye.</para>
  <para style="s">Majezo ya masa</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 9:42-48; Luka 17:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Wantu waidi wakusaga mpuluzi na yuwe kulu dya kusagila, uneva yoyose namhose yumwenga mwa wana wadodo wano aleke kunizumila, navitende vitana mntu uyo atalizwe mwe singo yuwe kulu dya kusagila, niyo adidimizwa hasi mwe bahali.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="MAT 18.6">Wantu waidi wakusaga kwa yuwe kulu dyakusagila</figure> <verse number="7" style="v" />Nawaluwone wantu we isi ino vifingo vikuwatenda wantu waleke uzumizi wawo! Vintu saivyo navilaile, mna namanye mwenye akuyatenda yalaile!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Uneva umkono wako hegu chiga chako vyakuhosa udamanye masa, vikante ukavidule hale na weye. Ni vitana kwingila mo ujima wa mazuwa yose hwina mkono hegu chiga, ukaleka kutenda una mikono midi hegu viga vidi udulwe mo moto wa mazuwa yose. <verse number="9" style="v" />Naho uneva ziso dyako dyakuhosa udamanye masa ding'ole ukadidule hale na weye. Ni vitana kwingila mo ujima hwina ziso, ukaleka kutenda na meso maidi udulwe mwe dibome hedina uhelo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa ngoto yagile</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 15:3-7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Msinyise mnase kubela yumwenga mwa wadodo wano. Nawagambilani kugamba wandima wa kwembingu wawo wa uko kwe mbingu mazuwa yose wausinya uso wa Tati yangu ekwe mbingu. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kwaviya Mwana ywa Mntu ezaga kuhonya wagile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mwafanyanya vihi? Mntu mta ngoto gana, niyo imwenga yaga nazase izintuhu milongo chenda na chenda zikadya holugulu niyo aita akalonde idya yagile. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nawagambilani taile, umo anaizungula naeleleswe mwe ngoto ino kuleka ziya milongo chenda na chenda hezagile. <verse number="14" style="v" />Seivyo Tati yenyu ekwembingu hakuvyunga yumwenga yoyose mwe wadodo wage.</para>
  <para style="s">Mlukolo akudamanya masa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Uneva mlukolo ywako kakudamanyiza masa, mwitile ukamlagise uwihi wakwe. Mna idamanye chinyele, nyuwe wenye waidi du. Uneva anakwiva, kumhonya mlukolo ywako. <verse number="16" style="v" />Mna uneva hakwivile, guha mntu yumenga hegu waidi mwitanye, chani chila ulosi uukulwe kwa kuwona ni waukuzi waidi hegu watatu saviya Mawandiko Yakukile yakulonga. <verse number="17" style="v" />Hana wevile awo, ilongeni imbuli injima kwa wantu wa nyumba yo kuvikila. Kukomelekela, uneva hanevile wantu wa nyumba yo kuvikila, mtendeni saviya mntu hemzumile Chohile hegu mchisanya kodi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulemela na Kuzumila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nawagambilani ichindedi, icho mkunga mchilemele mwe isi nachilemelwe kwembingu, naho mkunga mchizumile mwe isi nachizumilwe kwe mbingu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Naho nawagambilani taile, waidi wenyu mwe isi mnaivana mwe chochose mkulombeza, namdamanyizwe ni Tati yangu ywa kwembingu. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kwaviya waidi hegu watatu wakadugana kwa zina dyangu, miye nami nanitende hamwenga nawo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa Mndima hena mbazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Petulo niyo ambasa Yesu amuza, “Zumbe, uneva mlukolo ywangu ajendeleza kunijela mwe masa, nimlekeile nkanana nyingahi? Nkanana mfungate?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Bule, siyo nkanana mfugate,” “mna nkanana milongo mfugate na mfungate. <verse number="23" style="v" />Kwaviya Useuta wa kwembingu uligana sa vino. Hendaga na seuta aungile kuwaza wandima wakwe. <verse number="24" style="v" />Iviya akakonga kuwaza, egailwa mntu yumwenga mta deni dya hela zakwe milongo magana mlongo. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mndima uyo nahana chakuvuza kuligana na viya aguhile, ivyo zumbe uyo amunga atagwe saiya mtumwa, mkaziwe hamwenga na wanawe na vyoseni ananavyo, vikaleka akavuza viya aguhile. <verse number="26" style="v" />Yudya mndima amfikila madi zumbe. Alombeza, ‘Ni jijimiza, nahuvuzize chila chintu!’ <verse number="27" style="v" />Zumbe amfilambazi yudya mtumwa, ivyo amlekeila asekuvuza viya aguhile naho amleka aite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Niyo yudya mndima ahalawa, adugana na mndima mnyawe mta deni dya wahela wakwe. Amkagatila nakukonga kumvinya. Agamba, ‘Vuza chiya hwinkile!’ <verse number="29" style="v" />Mndima mnyawe amgwela na kumlombeza, ‘Nijijimiza, nahuvuzize viya uninkile!’ <verse number="30" style="v" />Mna kalemela, amjela mndani vibule aho akunga avuze kadya katigizo. <verse number="31" style="v" />Wandima weyawe watuhu weze wawone ivyo vilaile, wengilwa ni chinyulu vitendese, waita wakumgambila zumbe yoseni yalaile. <verse number="32" style="v" />Ivyo zumbe amwitangila yudya mndima kunyumba. Agamba, ‘Weye mndima wihiye, na sikulekeila deni hwinkile, kwaviya du kunilombeza hufile mbazi. <verse number="33" style="v" />Navyungwa umfile mbazi mndima mnyawo, saviya miye hufile mbazi.’ <verse number="34" style="v" />Zumbe kengilwa ni maya vidala, niyo amjela umndima uyo kundani asulumizwe vibule kuvuza kadya katigizo aguhile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Yesu akomeleza, “Ivyo nivyo Tate ywa kwembingu nakutendele, huna walekeile walukolo wako kulaila mo moyo wako.”</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahinya vikunga kwasana</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 10:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu eze abinde ulosi uwo, kakulawa Galilaya na kubula mwe mihaka ya Yudeya, ntendele ya kaidi yo mto Yolodani. <verse number="2" style="v" />Fyo kulu dya wantu dimtimila Yesu, awahonya uko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wambasa Yesu wakamjeza kwa kumuza, “Togola, Sigilizi yagaze ni vitana mntu kumwasa mkaziwe kwa lema dyodyose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Hamwasomaga Mawandiko yakugamba uyo Awaumbaga aho nkongo, aumbaga mntu mgosi na mntu mvyele? <verse number="5" style="v" />Elo agamba, ‘Kwe chausa icho mntu namwase tati yakwe na mami yakwe, na kulungana na mkaziwe, naho awo waidi na watende mwili umwenga.’ <verse number="6" style="v" />Ivyo watenda sawo waidi naho, mna mwili umwenga. Elo mntu asekuchipagula chiya chilunganywe ni Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mafalisayo wamuza, “Ni kwa chasa chani vilekile Musa kasigila kuwandika talaka ya kumwasa mvyele?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Kwachausa cho udala we myoyo yenyu, Musa asigilaga muwase wavyele wenyu. Mna havyatendagwa kukongela aho nkongo yo kumbwa kwe isi. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ivyo nawagambilani, chila mntu namwase mkaziwe, uneva siyo kwa chausa cha chilanga, anasola mtuhu, mntu uyo ni mgonyi, naho mntu mtuhu namsole yudya mvyele asigwe, naye ni mgonyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Wanampina wakwe wamgamba, “Uneva ivyo nivyo viwagile mntu mwa mkaziwe, havi kuwagila kusola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Sawo wose nawahokele imbuli ino mkulonga, mna wadya du wawagilwe kwa Chohile. <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuna wagosi awamwenga hawakusola kwaviya nivyo welekwe wagwa, wamwenga watendwa ivyo ni wantu, watuhu wetenda wenye wagwa kwa chausa cha kusankanila Useuta wa kwembingu. Akuhokela mahinyo yano nazumile!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajimbika wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 10:13-16; Luka 18:15-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Wantu watuhu wamwigaila Yesu wana wadodo awaikiye mikono mlanga na awalombezeze, wanampina wawakwahila wadya wantu. <verse number="14" style="v" />Mna Yesu agamba, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kwangu, naho msekuwalemeza, kwaviya Useuta wa kwembingu ni wawantu waligane na wowo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Awaikiya mikono yakwe mlanga mwawo, niyo akulawa uko.</para>
  <para style="s">Mntu mgoli</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 10:17-31; Luka 18:18-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mntu yumwenga mgoli amwizilaga Yesu, amuza, “Mhinyi, nidamanye mbuli yani yedi chani nihokele ujima wa mazuwa yose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Nimbwani ukunuza mwe mbuli yedi? Eyuko yumwenga uyodu ywedi. Mna ukaunga kwingila mo ujima, toza malagizo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Yudya mntu auza, “Sigilizi zihi hungigwa ni toze?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula, “Use kukoma, use kugonya, use kubawa, use kulonga lulimi, <verse number="19" style="v" />weve tati yako na mami yako, na munge mbwiyayo saviya ukweunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yudya mntu ahitula, “Sizitoza kale zose, sisigaza chimbwani naho?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Ukaunga utende utogile, hita ukatage vyose unanavyo, uwenke wachiwa ugoli uwo, nawe nautende na mpamba kwembingu. Ukaheza wize unitimile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yudya mbwanga eze eve imbuli idya, kaita ulo na ulo kwaviya nani mgoli vitendese.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Nawagambilani chindedi, navitende vidala mgoli kwingila mo Useuta wa kwembingu. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nawagambilani vituhu, nivihufu vitendese ngamiya kwingila mwe langa dya singano, ukaleka mgoli kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Wanampina weze weve ivyo, niyo weheleswa, wakagamba, “Niyuhi elo akudaha kwambulwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Yesu awang'oila meso, awagamba, “Kwa wantu idyo hadikudahika, mna kwa Chohile yose yadahika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Akaheza Petulo amgamba, “Kaula, suwe chileka vyose chikutimila weye, ivyo nachihokele chibwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, mwe isi mpya, Mwana ywa Mntu aho nekale mwe chigoda chakwe cho Useuta china ukulu, nyuwe mlongo na waidi mnitimile nanywi namwikale mwe vigoda mlongo na vidi, mkawakantila makabila mlongo na maidi ya Izulaeli. <verse number="29" style="v" />Naho chila mntu asize nyumba, hegu mlukolo ywa chilume hegu ywa chiche, hegu tati yakwe, hegu mami yakwe, wana hegu nkonde kwa chausa changu, naahokele nkanana zilozize kujinka naho neenkigwe ujima wa mazuwa yose. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mna wendile wa nkongo nawatende wo dumo, na wadya wazigile nawatende wa nkongo.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Wandima mwe nkonde ye mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Useuta wa kwembingu wikala saviya mntu mta nkonde yakwe ya mizabibu elauke chilochilo kulonda wantu wandima mwe nkonde yakwe. <verse number="2" style="v" />Evana na wandima wasiku kuwaliha maliho ya mazwela ya zuwa dimwenga, niyo awasigila kwe nkonde yakwe. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ize ibule saa ntatu ya mtondo, niyo afosa vituhu na kubwila watuhu wamile kwechimaila hedigwilo, hewena cha kudamanya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Awagamba, ‘Nyuwe nanywi mwite kwe nkonde yangu, naniwaliheni saviya vikuwoneka vyedi.’ <verse number="5" style="v" />Ivyo waita. Ize ibule saa mtandatu na saa chenda afosa naho, niyo adamanya saiviya adamanye. <verse number="6" style="v" />Haguhi na saa mlongo na imwenga niyo afosa vituhu naho, abwila wantu watuhu wamile kwechimaila hantu ahadya. Awauza, ‘Ni mbwani mwechimaila msi mjima hemwikudamanya ndima?’ <verse number="7" style="v" />Wahitula, ‘Hahana achinkinkile ndima.’ Awagamba, ‘Ni vyedi, nyuwe nanywi mwite mkadamanye ndima kwe nkonde yangu ye mizabibu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Chisingi chize chibule, mwenye nkonde amgamba Zumbe wakwe, ‘Itanga awandima wose uwalihe amaliho yawo, akonga yudya azigile kwiza nakukomeleza kwa wadya wankongo.’ <verse number="9" style="v" />Wandima wakongile ndima sa mlongo na imwenga walihwa chila yumwenga maliho ya zuwa dimwenga. <verse number="10" style="v" />Na wadya walongole kukonga indima weza, nawakafanyanya kugamba nawalihwe kujinka watuhu, mna nawo walihwa maliho ya zuwa dimwenga chila yumwenga. <verse number="11" style="v" />Waguha hela zawo nakukonga kumng'ung'uzikila mwenye inkonde. <verse number="12" style="v" />Wagamba, ‘Wandima wano wazigile wadamanya ndima kwa saa dimwenga du, suwe chidamanya kwa msi mjima naho kwa kujijimiza mwe dizuwa. Kuwaliha viligane na suwe!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mwenye inkonde amhitula yumwenga ywawo, ‘Mbuyangu, kwetegeleze, sikupunjize. Hachivane kugamba nahulihe ndima ya zuwa kwa maliho ya zuwa dimwenga? <verse number="14" style="v" />Elo hokela amaliho yako wite kaya. Sunga ni mwinke yuno azigile kuligana na viya hulihile weye. <verse number="15" style="v" />Togola, viha miye kudamanya viya hunga mwe zihela zangu? Hegu wengilwa ni finju kwaviya miye ni ywedi?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Niyo Yesu abindiliza, “Ivyo wadya wa kuzigila haluse na watende wa nkongo na wa nkongo vino haluse na watende waudumo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atamwila nkanana ya katatu ifile yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 10:32-34; Luka 18:31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Umo Yesu akakwela kubula Yelusalemu, awaguhaga wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi hankanda he sila nakutamwila nawo chinyele, awagamba, <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kaulani,” “Chaita Yelusalemu, kudya Mwana ywa Mntu nalavigwe kwa wakulu wa walavyantambiko na kwa wahinya Sigilizi. Nawamkantile file, <verse number="19" style="v" />niyo wamwinkiza kwa wantu sawo Wayahudi, wakunga wambele, wamtowe, na kumsulumiza mo msalaba, mna mazuwa matatu yakutimila nauyuke.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya mami ya mntu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 10:35-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Niyo mkaza Zebedayo hamwenga na wanawe wambasa Yesu, wamfikila madi nakumlombeza mbuli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu amuza, “Waunga mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Amhitula, “Mwo Useuta wako uwazumile wano wanangu waidi wekale yumwenga kulume kwako no mtuhu mo mkono wako wa kumoso.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yesu awahitula awo wana, “Hamvimanyize ivyo mkulombeza, vino mwadaha kunywela chikombe cha masulumizo hunga ninywele?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wahitula, “Chavidaha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, “Nichindedi namnywe mwe chikombe changu, mna sina udahi wa kusagula wa kwikala kulume kwangu hegu kumoso kwangu. Mna hantu hano ni kwa wadya wasagulwe kale ni Tate awaikiye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Wadya wanampina watuhu mlongo weze weve ivyo, niyo wawehiwa awo walukolo waidi. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ivyo Yesu niyo awetanga akawagamba, “Mvimanya kugamba vilongozi hewemzumile Chohile wana udahi mwawo, vilongozi nawo wana udahi uchintile. <verse number="26" style="v" />Vino havikungwa vidamanywe mgati mwenyu. Uneva yumwenga aunga atende mkulu, atende mndima ywa wasigale, <verse number="27" style="v" />naho akunga atende wa nkongo atende mndima ywenyu, <verse number="28" style="v" />seivyo Mwana ywa Mntu, hezile kusankanilwa, mna kusankanila na kulavya ujima wakwe utende maliho ya wantu walozize.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahonya Matuntu Waidi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 10:46-52; Luka 18:35-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Umo Yesu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe wakahalawa mo mzi wa Yeliko, fyo kulu dya wantu nadikatimila. <verse number="30" style="v" />Wantu waidi matuntu nawekala mnkanda mweisila weva kugamba Yesu naakajinka, ivyo wakonga kuguta, “Mwana ywa Daudi! Chifile mbazi Zumbe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Idifyo dyawakwamila nakuwagamba wanyamale. Mna wagutisa, “Zumbe Mwana ywa Daudi! Chifile mbazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Yesu achimala nakuwetanga. Awauza, “Mwaunga niwadamanyize mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Wahitula, “Zumbe, chakunga uchitende chiwone!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu awafila mbazi na kudonta meso yawo, aho wadaha kuwona, niyo wamtimila.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu engila Yelusalemu kwa chinyemi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 11:1-11; Luka 19:28-40; Yohana 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Umo Yesu na wanampina wakwe weze waisogeile Yelusalemu, wabula Betifage mo Lugulu lwa Mizeituni. Uko Yesu kawasigila wanampina wakwe waidi walongole, <verse number="2" style="v" />awagamba, “Hitani hekaya ikulongozi kwenyu, aho nambwile mpunda italizwe na mwana mpunda ywakwe. Zifunguleni mnigaile. <verse number="3" style="v" />Uneva mntu anawauzani chochose, mgambeni, ‘Zumbe awaunga,’ naye nawalekele aho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mbuli ino ilaila chani yadya yalongigwe ni muwoni yachinte.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ugambileni umzi wa Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q">Kaula seuta ywako akwizila!</para>
  <para style="q">Ni mnyanyahala naho kakwela mpunda</para>
  <para style="q">na mwana mpunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ivyo, wadya wanampina waita niyo wadamanya saviya Yesu awasigile wadamanye. <verse number="7" style="v" />Wegala mpunda na mwana mpunda, watandika izi suche zawo mlanga mwe zimpunda, Yesu naye niyo ekala mlanga. <verse number="8" style="v" />Fyo kulu dya wantu ditandika izisuche zawo mwe isila, watuhu wafyola matambi ya miti na kuyatandaza mwe isila. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mafyo ya wantu ya mlongwela Yesu, wadya nawo wakumtimila hanyuma wagutila, “Jimbiko kwa mwana ywa Daudi! Ajimbikwe uyo akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe! Jimbiko kwa Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Umo Yesu akengila Yelusalemu, wantu wo umzi umjima wabwikana moto. Wantu wauza, “Yuno ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amafyo yahitula, “Yuno ni muwoni Yesu, kalawa Nazaleti si ya Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwe Nyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 11:15-19; Luka 19:45-48; Yohana 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Yesu engila mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, awabalaziza kuse wantu wendile wakataga na kugula vintu mndani umo. Kahitula izimeza za wadya wendile wakavunjizana hela na vigoda vya wadya wendile wakataga wasuwamanga. <verse number="13" style="v" />Awagamba, “Iwandikwa mwa Mawandiko Yakukile kugamba Chohile kalonga, ‘Nyumba ya Chohile naitangwe nyumba ya kumlombeza Chohile.’ Mna nyuwe mwitenda ‘Nyumba ya kwefisiza wabavi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Matuntu na waholomale wambasaga uko kwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, niyo awahonya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wahinya Sigilizi wehiwa weze wawone izimpituko adamanye Yesu, hamwenga na wana wakuguta mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, “Ntunyo kwa Mwana ywa Daudi!” <verse number="16" style="v" />Ivyo wamuza Yesu, “Togola, weva icho wakulonga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ahitula, “Heye, neva! Hamsomile mawandiko yano? ‘Kuhinya wana na wazana wachembe kutogola viya vikuwagila,’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Yesu awasa nakubula kuse ko mzi wa Besaniya, agona uko.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aligita mtini</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 11:12-14, 20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Umo Yesu emwesila akauya komzi nomtondo nakalumwa nisala. <verse number="19" style="v" />Awona mtini umwenga mnkanda mwe isila, niyo aubasa mna kaubwila hewina tunda dyodyose, na mani ayodu. Ivyo augamba, “Haweleke naho matunda mazuwa yose!” Aho udya umtini unyala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Wanampina weze wawone niyo wehelwa, wauza, “Umtini uno usunguza kunyala vivihi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Nawagambilani chindedi, uneva mnazumila hemwina nkama, namdahe kudamanya vino nidamanye mo mtini uno. Naho sivyo vino du, mna namdahe hata kulonga ko lugulu luno, ‘Ng'oka ukedule mwe bahali,’ naho navitende ivyo. <verse number="22" style="v" />Uneva mwazumila, namhokele chochose mkulombeza mo kumlombeza Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuuza mwe udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 11:27-33; Luka 20:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yesu engilaga mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, umo akahinya, wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wadalahala wa wantu wambasa wamuza, “Wadamanya mbuli zino kwa udahi wa yuhi? Naho ni yuhi akwinkile udahi uno?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Naniwauzeni swali dimwenga, mnanihitula, naniwagambileni nadamanya mbuli zino kwa udahi wa yuhi. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nigambilani, udahi wa Yohana wo kubatiza walawaga kuhi? Walawaga kwa Chohile hegu walawaga kwa wantu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wakonga kulosana wowo wenye kwa wenye, “Chigambe mbwani? Uneva chinahitula, ‘Ulaila kwembingu,’ naachigambe, Ni mbwani naho hamwamzumilaga Yohana?” <verse number="26" style="v" />Mna chinagamba, “kulaila kwa wantu, chogoha wantu viya nawatende, kwaviya wantu wose wamzumila Yohana kugamba ni muwoni.” <verse number="27" style="v" />Ivyo wamhitula Yesu, “Hachivimanyize.”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo awagamba, Miye nami saniwagambileni nadamanya mbuli zino kwa udahi wa yuhi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa wana waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Haluse, mwafanyanya vihi kwa dino? Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga endaga na wanawe waidi. Uyo niyo amgamba mwanawe ywa nkongo kugamba, ‘Mwanagu, dyelo hita ukadamanye ndima kwe nkonde ye mizabibu.’ <verse number="29" style="v" />Niyo ahitula, ‘Sikunga,’ Mna nyumani niyo ahitwila fanyanyi zakwe niyo aita. <verse number="30" style="v" />Yudya tati ya mntu niyo ambasa mwanawe ywa kaidi amgambila seiviya amgambile yudya ywe nkongo. Uyo niyo amhitula, ‘Heye Zumbe,’ mna haitile. <verse number="31" style="v" />Togolani, niyuhi mgati mwa wano waidi adamanye viungile tati yakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">“Ywa nkongo,” Wahitula.</para>
  <para style="p">Ivyo Yesu awagamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, wachisanya kodi na wachilanga na wawalongweleni kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile. <verse number="32" style="v" />Kwaviya Yohana ezaga kwenyu kuwalagisa sila ya kuwoneka wedi, nyuwe hamumzumile, mna wachisanya kodi na wachilanga wamzumilaga. Hata umo mwawonaga yano, hamweile fanyanyi zenyu na kumzumila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa walimi mwe nkonde ye mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 12:1-12; Luka 20:9-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Yesu agamba, “Tegelezani mliganyo mtuhu, kwendaga na mntu mta nkonde ahandaga mizabibu, niyo aizungulusiza mnulu, asimba bome dya kufumbwila zabibu nakuzenga mnala. Niyo alekeila walimi inkonde iyo nakutamba. <verse number="34" style="v" />Chipindi cho uvuni chize chibule, asigila wandima wakwe kwa wadya walimi, wakachisanye ulozo wakwe. <verse number="35" style="v" />Wadya walimi niyo wawagwila wandima wakwe, wamtowa uyumwenga, mtuhu wamkoma, mtuhu naye wamtowa mayuwe. <verse number="36" style="v" />Yudya mntu naho egala wandima watuhu walozize, kujinka wadya we nkongo, wadya walimi wawausa chisimo saichiya. <verse number="37" style="v" />Kokukomeleza amwigala mwanawe kwawo, akagamba, ‘Ichindedi nawamtunye mwanangu.’ <verse number="38" style="v" />Mna wadya walimi weze wamwone yudya mwana, wegamba, ‘Yuno nuyo mlisi we nkonde. Chimkomeni chiguhe ulisi wakwe!’ <verse number="39" style="v" />Ivyo wamgwila, wamdula kuse kwe nkonde ye mizabibu niyo wamkoma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Yesu auza, “Haluse, aho akwizila Zumbe mwenye nkonde ye mizabibu nawadamanye chibwani wadya walimi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Wahitula, “Ichindedi nawakome wadya wantu wehi, niyo enka inkonde ye mizabibu walimi watuhu, wakunga wamwinke ulozo wakwe mwe chipindi chikungwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Yesu awagamba, Hamwasomaga viya Mawandiko Yakukile yakulonga?</para>
  <para style="q">Yuwe dilemelwe ni wazesi</para>
  <para style="q">dihitukila dikungisiswa mwa yoseni.</para>
  <para style="q">Ulosi uno ulaila kwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q">nawo ni maula mwa meso yetu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Yesu ajeleka, Ivyo nawagambilani, namhokwe Useuta wa Chohile niyo wenkwa wantu watuhu sawo Wayahudi weleke matunda yawagile. <verse number="44" style="v" />Akunga agwe mwe diyuwe naavunike vunike, na uyo dikunga dimfunte nadimtiginte tiginte.” Mawandiko matuhu hayana uno msitali.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Wakulu wa walavyantambiko na Mafalisayo, weva miliganyo ya Yesu, wabunkula kugamba awalonga wowo. <verse number="46" style="v" />Ivyo wazungula ubala wakumgwila. Mna nawakogoha amafyo ya wantu wakumwona Yesu sa muwoni.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa Ngasu ya Nyinka</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 14:15-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu alonga nawo kwa miliganyo, akagamba. <verse number="2" style="v" />“Useuta wa kwembingu uligana sa vino. Kwendaga na seuta amdamanyize mwanawe wa chilume nyinka. <verse number="3" style="v" />Kasigila wandima wakwe wawetange wadya wagonekwe kwe nyika, nawo niyo walemela kwiza. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ivyo asigila wandima watuhu akagamba, ‘Ngasu yangu yajika, ng'ombe zangu na vinonile vichinjwa kale, na vyose viheza kale. Soni kwe ngasu ye nyinka!’ <verse number="5" style="v" />Mna awajeni wagonekwe hawaitolotoze niyo wadamanya zawo, yumwenga kaita kwe nkonde yakwe, mtuhu kwediyombe dyakwe, <verse number="6" style="v" />wasigale niyo wawagwila wadya wandima wakwe, wawahuta na kuwakoma. <verse number="7" style="v" />Yudya seuta niyo ehiwa vidala, egala wankondo wakwe wakomile wadya wakomi na kuutimpa moto umzi wawo. <verse number="8" style="v" />Akaheza awagamba wandima wakwe, ‘Inyinka yemalanya kale, mna sawo wadya wagonekwe nawo wawagile kudya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Hitani kwe zisila mpanda muwetange wose mkunga muwabwile weze kwe nyinka.’ <verse number="10" style="v" />Ivyo wandima waita kwezisila wawachisanya wantu wose wawawone, wehiye na wedi, nyinka niyo yamema wajeni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mna seuta eze engile kukaula wajeni, niyo abunkula mntu hevikile suche ye nyinka. <verse number="12" style="v" />Amuza, ‘Mbuyangu, kwingila vivihi hano hwivikile suche ye nyinka?’ Mna uyo mntu halongile dyodyose. <verse number="13" style="v" />Niyo seuta awagamba wandima wakwe, ‘Mtalizeni mwe mikono na mweviga, mumdule kuse kwe chiza. Uko naile na kusiginta meno yakwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Yesu akomeleza, “Kwaviya wagonekwe ni waloza, mna wasagulwe ni wajeche.”</para>
  <para style="s">Swali mwe kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 12:13-17; Luka 20:20-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mafalisayo niyo waita wakaike ubala wa kumgwila Yesu mo ulosi wakwe. <verse number="16" style="v" />Wasigila wanampina wakwe hamwenga na wantu wa Helode. Wagamba, “Mhinyi, chimanya kugamba weye walonga chindedi. Wahinya ichindedi mwe viya akunga Chohile kwa chausa cha wantu, kuno hwikogoha viya watuhu wakufanyanya, kwaviya hukusinya viya mntu eli. <verse number="17" style="v" />Chigambile, wafanyanya vihi? Ni vyedi mwe sigilizi yetu kuliha kodi kwa mkulu ywa Chilumi hegu bule?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mna Yesu, niyo amanya ubala wawo wihiye, agamba, “Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Ni mbwani mkunijeza? <verse number="19" style="v" />Nilagisani hela yo kulihila kodi!”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wamwigaila hela, <verse number="20" style="v" />awauza, “Sula ne dizina ni vya yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Wahitula, “Ni vya Mkulu ywa Chilumi,”</para>
  <para style="p">Ivyo Yesu awagamba, “Ni vyedi, mwinkeni Mkulu ywa Chilumi viya vimuwagile, na Chohile vikumuwagila Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Weze weve ivyo, niyo wehelwa, wamleka wahalawa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya uyuso</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 12:8-27; Luka 20:27-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mwe dizuwa idyo Masadukayo wamwenga wamwitila Yesu wakalonga kugamba wantu hawauyuke. <verse number="24" style="v" />Wagamba, “Mhinyi, Musa alongaga kugamba mntu hena mwana akabanika, mlukolo ywakwe ampale mnamuwe, chani amwelekele wana. <verse number="25" style="v" />Haluse, kwendaga na walukolo mfungate. Ywankongo asolaga, niyo abanika. Kwaviya na hena cheleko, niyo amwasiza mlukolo ywakwe mkaziwe. <verse number="26" style="v" />Chintu icho kimlaila ywa kaidi na ywa katatu, vita ivyo kubula ywa mfungate. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ko uhelo yudya mvyele niyo abanika. <verse number="28" style="v" />Haluse chigambe mwe dizuwa dyo uyuso, mvyele yudya na atende wa yuhi? Woseni nawamsola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Yesu awahitula, “Mwagilisa! Nikwaviya hamyamanize mawandiko hegu nguvu za Chohile. <verse number="30" style="v" />Kwaviya mwe zuwa dya uyuso wantu, hawasole hegu kusolwa, nawekale saviya wandima wa kwembingu. <verse number="31" style="v" />Mna mwe wabanike uyuso, hamsomile viya Chohile awagambilaga?, <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Miye nuyo Chohile ywa Bulahimu, nuyo ywa Isaka, naho nuyo ywa Yakobo.’ Ni Chohile ywa wajima, suyo ywa wabanike.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Idifyo dya awantu dize dive vino, wehelwa amahinyo yakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi Nkulu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 12:28-34; Luka 10:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mafalisayo weze weve kugamba Yesu kawatenda Masadukayo wanyamale waswese dya kulonga, Mafalisayo niyo wekala hamwenga, <verse number="35" style="v" />yumwenga mwawo, mhinya Sigilizi, amjeza Yesu kwa kumuza. <verse number="36" style="v" />Amuza, “Mhinyi, Isigilizi nkulu ni ihi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “ ‘Munge Zumbe Chohile ywako kwa moyo wako wose, kwa ujima wako wose, na kwa umanyi wako woseni.’ <verse number="38" style="v" />Ino niyo Isigilizi inkulu naho niyo yankongo. <verse number="39" style="v" />Sigilizi ya kaidi ya kusinyisa sa iyo, ‘Munge mtuhu saviya ukweunga mwenye.’ <verse number="40" style="v" />Sigilizi yose ya Musa na mawandiko ya wawoni ikala mwe zisigilizi mbili zino.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Kulisito Mkombola alongigwe ni Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 12:35-37; Luka 20:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Umo Mafalisayo wamwenga weze wadugane, Yesu niyo awauza, <verse number="42" style="v" />“Mwafanyanya vihi mwa Kulisito Mkombola? Kalaila mo ulukolo lwa yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wahitula, “Ni mlukolo ywa Daudi,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Yesu auza, “Ni mbwani naho, Muye wa Chohile ukamwingila Daudi kumwitanga ‘Zumbe’? Daudi agambaga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />‘Zumbe alongaga kwa Zumbe ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q">Ikala hano kulume kwangu</para>
  <para style="q">kubula niwaike wehi wako mwe viga vyako.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Uneva haluse Daudi kamwitanga ‘Zumbe’, Kulisito Mkombozi atenda vivihi mlukolo ywa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hahalaile adahile kumhitula Yesu, kulaila mwe dizuwa idyo, hahali ajezize kumuza naho.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Afunda Wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 12:38-39; Luka 11:43, 46; 20:45-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu niyo alonga na kwa amafyo na kwa wanampina wakwe. <verse number="2" style="v" />Awagamba, “Wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo wenkwa udahi wa kulavyanya Sigilizi ya Musa. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ivyo tozani na kutimila chila wakuwagambilani mdamanye, mna msekwiga ntendwa zawo, kwaviya hawakudamanya viya wakulonga. <verse number="4" style="v" />Wafunga mizigo na kuwatwisa wantu mwamayega yawo mna wowo wenye hawakunga hata kuidonta na kadole. <verse number="5" style="v" />Wadamanya ntendwa zawo zose chani welagise kulongozi kwa wantu. Kaulani wavika wakota wawo wana Mawandiko Yakukile. Naho wavala nkazu na mahembe matali! <verse number="6" style="v" />Waunga kwikala mwe vigoda vi kulongozi mwe ngasu, na vikigwe na kuwandwa mwe nyumba zo kuvikila. <verse number="7" style="v" />Waunga kulamswa kwa kutunywa mwa magwilo na kunga kwitangwa ‘Mhinyi’. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mna nyuwe msekuzumila kwitangwa ‘Wahinyi’, kwaviya nyuwe wose mwi walukolo, nanywi mna Mhinyi yumwenga du. <verse number="9" style="v" />Naho msekumwitanga mntu yoyose ‘Tate’, hano he isi kwaviya Tati yenyu ni yumwenga kwembingu. <verse number="10" style="v" />Naho msekwitangwa ‘Chilongozi’, kwaviya mwi wamwenga naho chilongozi uyodu ni Kulisito Mkombola. <verse number="11" style="v" />Mkulu mgati mwenyu aungwa atende mndima ywenyu. <verse number="12" style="v" />Yoyose nekweze na aselezwe, akweseleza na akwezwe ni Chohile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga usongaganyi wawo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 12:40; Luka 11:39-42, 44, 52; 20:47</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Namvimanye wenye, wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Mwawavugaila wantu watuhu sila ya kwingila mo Useuta wa kwembingu nyuwe wenye hamkuwingila, naho hamkulekela wadya wakujeza kuwingila! <verse number="14" style="v" />Namluwone, nyuwe wahinyi wa Sigilizi na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Mwapolaganya ugoli wa wavyele wabanikilwe ni wagosi na kulombeza malombezo matali kwa kwelagisa. Kwa chausa icho kanto dyenyu naditende kulu ditendese!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Namvimanye wenye, wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Mwazunguluka mwe bahali na mwe isi chani mhokele mntu yumwenga atimile isila yenyu. Anazumila, mwamtenda mwana wa kwedibome hedina uhelo nkanana mbili kujinka nyuwe wenye!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Namluone, vilongozi matuntu! Mwagamba, ‘Uneva mntu elisa kwa Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, sicho chintu. Mna uneva mntu elisa kwa zahabu ya Nyumba ya Chohile, kegwiza.’ <verse number="17" style="v" />Nyuwe wahezi na matuntu! Chikulu ni chihi, zahabu hegu Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile ikutenda zahabu itende ikukile? <verse number="18" style="v" />Naho mwahinya, ‘Uneva mntu elisa kwa nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, sicho chintu, mna uneva mntu elisa kwa ntunyo imlanga mwe shanduku ya kulaviza jeleko mwakwe, kegwiza.’ <verse number="19" style="v" />Nyuwe matuntu! Chikulu ni chihi, shanduku ya kulaviza jeleko hegu nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko ikutenda jeleko dikukile? <verse number="20" style="v" />Ivyo mntu akwelisa kwa nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, elisa kwa iyo, na vintu vyose viyumo. <verse number="21" style="v" />Akwelisa ne Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, elisa kwa iyo, na kwa uyo Chohile akwikala mndani mwakwe. <verse number="22" style="v" />Uyo akwelisa kwa zina dya kwembingu, elisa kwe chigoda cho uzumbe wa Chohile mazuwa yose na kwauyo akwikala umo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Namluwone wenye, wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Mwamwinka Chohile hantu hamwenga mwe mlongo ha uvuni wa mhilimo, enga vitago na bizali na jila, mna mwaleka kutimila mahinyo yakungwa ya Sigilizi, saviya wedi wa Chohile na mbazi na ukanuni na uzumizi. Mwaungwa mvijese ivyo hemwi kuleka vituhu. <verse number="24" style="v" />Vilongozi matuntu! Mwafilihiza wadudu wadodo enga saviya mbu mwe mazi, mna mwamela ngamiya!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Namluwone, wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Mwalengusa viya vyenyu na vihungu kwa kuse na chano, mndani mmema uhoki na kwevutila. <verse number="26" style="v" />Weye Falisayo tuntu! Konga kulengusa mndani mwe chiya kuse nako nakutende kulenguka!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Namluone, wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Mligana na mbila zihakigwe chwakaa, kwa kuse ni ntana, mna mndani mmema mavuha ya wabanike na uzavu. <verse number="28" style="v" />Seivyo, kuse mwasinyika wantu wedi kwa chilayumwenga, mna mndani mmema usongaganyi na masa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alotela nkanto zao</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 11:47-51</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Namluone, wahinya Sigilizi na Mafalisayo! Nyuwe wasongaganyi! Mwazengela wawoni mbila ntana nakuzika untanda mbila za wantu wawoneke wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile. <verse number="30" style="v" />Naho mwagamba, hegu suwe chendaga hamwenga mwe chikale cha wadalahala wetu, hachehangile nawo mo kuwakoma wawoni. <verse number="31" style="v" />Elo mweukuila wenye, kugamba nyuwe mwiwana wawadya wawakomile wawoni! <verse number="32" style="v" />Haya komelezani ndima waikongile wadalahala wenyu! <verse number="33" style="v" />Nyuwe fyo dya nyoka! Namwenege vivihi nkanto dya kwe bome hedina uhelo? <verse number="34" style="v" />Kwaivyo, nawegailani wawoni na wata ubala na wahinya Sigilizi. Wamwenga wenyu namuwakome na kuwasulumiza, watuhu namuwatowe mwe nyumba yo kuvikila na kuwagulusa mzi kubula mzi. <verse number="35" style="v" />Mwe ivyo, namlihizwe sakame itike mwe isi ino hewena masa, kukongela ukomi wa Habili awoneke ywedi kwa Chohile kubula ukomi wa Zakaliya mwana Balakiya, mwamkomaga mgati mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile na mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse number="36" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, ukomi uno woseni naugwele mwe wantu we icheleko chino.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ayunga Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 13:34-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu! Ukuwakoma wawoni, na kuwatowa wasigilwe kwako ni Chohile! Ninkanana nyingahi sunga niwachisanye hamwenga wanawo, saviya nguku ikufuwatila wanawe hasi ha mawawa yakwe, mna hamvyungile! <verse number="38" style="v" />Ivyo, Nyumba ya Chohile naibomolwe ikale isamigwe. <verse number="39" style="v" />Nawagambilani kukongela vino haluse, hamniwone naho kubula mgambe, ‘Chohile mjimbike akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Alonga Uvuni wa Nyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 13:1-2; Luka 21:5-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu nakafosa mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile naho na akahalawa umo wanampina wakwe wambasize chani wamlagise mazengo ye mwe Nyumba ya Chohile. <verse number="2" style="v" />Auza, “Mwayawona yano yose? Nawagambilani chindedi, hano hadisigale yuwe mlanga mwe mnyawe, chila dimwenga nadidulwe hasi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nkunto na Masulumizo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 13:3-13; Luka 21:7-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Umo Yesu endaga ahumule ko Lugulu lwa Mizeituni, wanampina wakwe wambasaga kwa chinyele, wauza, “Chigambile, mbuli zino nazilaile ini? Ni chilagiso chani chokwiza kwako, na udumo we isi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yesu ahitula, “Msinyise, mntu ase kuwadanta. <verse number="5" style="v" />Kwaviya wantu walozize nawalaile waketanga kwa zina dyangu, wakagamba, ‘Miye nuyo Kulisito Mkombola!’ Nawo na wadante walozize. <verse number="6" style="v" />Namwive mbuli za nkondo na hambwe hambwe dya nkondo, kaulani, msekutiswa, kwaviya ayo yaungwa yalaile, mna udya udumo haunati. <verse number="7" style="v" />Si naitowane na si ntuhu, useuta nautowane na useuta. Nakutende na gumbo, na visingisa chila hantu. <verse number="8" style="v" />Yose ayo nayekale saviya usungu wa nkongo wa kwefungula mwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Vikajika namlavigwe chani msulumizwe, nakukomwa, nanywi namwihiwe ni wantu wa si ntuhu zose kwa chausa changu. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mwe ichipindi icho walozize nawahige uzumizi wawo naho nawaihiwane na kulemana. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nawalaile wawoni wadanti walozize, wakunga wawadante wantu walozize. <verse number="12" style="v" />Kwa chausa cha kujenyela kwa wihi, uungi wa wantu walozize nauhunguke. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mna mntu akunga ajijimize kubula kodumo nuyo akunga akombolwe. <verse number="14" style="v" />Naho Mbuli Yedi ya Useuta nailongwe mwe isi yose, utende ukuzi kwa wantu we si ntuhu yose, aho naho udya udumo naubule.</para>
  <para style="s">Chintu chihiye chikudaha kubalanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 13:14-23; Luka 21:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Namumwone uyo akwitangwa ‘Ihizo dya ubanasi’ chilongingwe ni muwoni Danieli. Nachichimale hantu hakukile.” Akusoma na abunkule! <verse number="16" style="v" />Niyo wose we mwe isi ya Yudeya, nawasumkile ko lugulu. <verse number="17" style="v" />Yudya ekulanga kwedigulu asekusela kuviguha vintu vimwenyumba yakwe, <verse number="18" style="v" />Naho ekwenkonde, asekuya kunyuma kuguha suche yakwe. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nawamanye wenye watanda na wakonkeza mwa mazuwa ayo! <verse number="20" style="v" />Mlombezeni Chohile, chani kuguluka kwenyu kusekutenda mwempeho, hegu mwe zuwa dya kuhumula. <verse number="21" style="v" />Kwaviya nakutende na nkunto nkulu, idya heinati kulaila kukongela isi heinati kumbwa kubula vino haluse, naho hazize zilaile vituhu. <verse number="22" style="v" />Hegu Chohile hahunguze mazuwa ayo ye zinkunto hahendile na mntu hata yumwenga ahonile mwe file. Mna kwa chausa cha wantu wakwe asagule, Chohile nayahunguze mazuwa ayo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Naho, mntu akawagambani, ‘Kaula, Kulisito ehano!’ Hegu ‘Ekudya!’ Msekumzumila. <verse number="24" style="v" />Kwaviya nawalaile makulisito wadanti, na wawoni wadanti, nawo nawadamanye mpituko nkulu na vilagiso, chani, vikadahika, wawadante hata wantu wasagulwe ni Chohile. <verse number="25" style="v" />Kaulani, silongola kuwagambilani yakwiza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ivyo, uneva wantu wakawagambani, ‘Kaulani, ekwenyika!’ Mse kwita uko, hegu wakawagambani, ‘Kaulani, kefisa kuno!’ Msekuzumila. <verse number="27" style="v" />Kwaviya ni saviya lumwemwe lukumulika ulailo wa zuwa lukawoneka uswelo wa zuwa, ivyo nivyo na kutende kwiza kwakwe Mwana ywa Mntu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Kwaviya hohose hana chimba, naho nayadugane magushu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana ywa Mntu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 13:24-27; Luka 21:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Mna Aho, vikajinka ukukunta mwa mazuwa ayo, zuwa nadijelwe chiza, mnenge haulangaze, ntondo nazigwe kulaila kwembingu, nguvu za kwembingu nazisingisike, <verse number="30" style="v" />Naho nachiwoneke chilagiso cha Mwana ywa Mntu kwembingu, naho wantu wose we isi nawaile, nawo nawaile Mwana ywa Mntu akeza mlanga mwa maingu hamwenga na nguvu za ukulu ulozize. <verse number="31" style="v" />Naawasigile wandima wa kwembingu wakwe hamwenga na izwi kulu dya gunda, nawo nawawachisanye wasagulwa wakwe kulaila ntendele nne, kulaila ko udumo uno kwita ko udumo uno.</para>
  <para style="s">Hinani kulawana na Mtini</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 13:28-31; Luka 21:29-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Ivyo ko mti ukwitangwa mtini mhine mliganyo, tambi dyakwe dikasuka mani na kubwalika mwamanya kugamba chipindi cha fula chihajihi, <verse number="33" style="v" />Seivyo nanywi, mkayawona ayo yose, bunkulani kugamba Mwana ywa Mntu ehaguhi na kwiza. <verse number="34" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, vintu vyose vino navilaile umo wantu wa haluse hawanati kubanika. <verse number="35" style="v" />Mbingu ne isi na vijinke, mna mbuli zangu hazomboke ng'o.</para>
  <para style="s">Hahali amanyize idizuwa ne isa</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 13:32-37; Luka 17:26-30, 34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Hahali mntu yoyose amanyize idizuwa idyo na chipindi, hata wandima wa kwembingu hata Mwana, mna Tate ichedu nuyo amanyize. <verse number="37" style="v" />Saviya vyendaga mwa mazuwa ya Nuhu, nivyo navitendeke kwiza kwakwe Mwana ywa Mntu. <verse number="38" style="v" />Saviya mwa mazuwa hevinati kulaila galika wantu wendaga wakadya, na kunywa, wakasola na kusolwa, vikabula zuwa diya Nuhu engilaga mwe ngalawa nkulu, <verse number="39" style="v" />wasekumanya, niyo galika yeza, yawaguha wose, nivyo na kutendeke kwiza kwakwe Mwana ywa Mntu. <verse number="40" style="v" />Wantu waidi nawatende kwenkonde, yumwenga na aguhigwe yumwenga asigwa. <verse number="41" style="v" />Wavyele waidi na watende wabunda, yumwenga aguhigwa, yumwenga asigwa. <verse number="42" style="v" />Ivyo chelezani, kwaviya hammanyize aho neezile Zumbe dyenyu. <verse number="43" style="v" />Mna mmanye mbuli ino, uneva mta nyumba amanyize hadya nezile mbavi, nakacheleza, naho halekile inyumba yakwe ivunwe. <verse number="44" style="v" />Kwe chausa icho nyuwe nanywi mwikale mhezize, kwaviya mwe saa hemwimanyize Mwana ywa Mntu eza.</para>
  <para style="s">Mndima ywedi hegu Mndima aihiye</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 12:41-48</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Elo ni yuhi mndima mkanuni mta fanyanyi, yudya zumbe dyakwe nakamwika mwe nyumba yakwe, awenke wantu nkande mwe chipindi chikuwagila? <verse number="46" style="v" />Chinyemi china yudya mndima yudya hadya zumbe dyakwe akwizila na ambwile adamanya ivyo. <verse number="47" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi naamwike atende mdimi mkulu mo wakwe wose. <verse number="48" style="v" />Mna mndima yudya aihiye akagamba mo moyo wakwe, ‘Zumbe dyangu akawa ukwiza,’ <verse number="49" style="v" />Naho niyo akonga kuwatowa wandima weyawe na kudya na kunywa hamwenga na wakozi. <verse number="50" style="v" />Zumbe dyakwe umndima uyo neeze zuwa hedimanyize, na chipindi hemanyize. <verse number="51" style="v" />Namtowe vitendese na kumsulumiza seiviya na wantu wasongaganyi, akamwika hantu hendilo na kusiginta meno.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa wandele Mlongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Naho, Useuta wa kwembingu nauligane na wandele mlongo, waguhile taa zawo, niyo waita kumgoja msola. <verse number="2" style="v" />Washano mwe wadya nendile ni wahezi, washano wendaga ni wabala. <verse number="3" style="v" />Wadya wahezi waguha taa zawo, mna hawaguhile na mavuta ya kongezeza. <verse number="4" style="v" />Mna wadya wabala waguha mavuta mwe supa hamwenga ne zita zawo. <verse number="5" style="v" />Kwaviya msola kakawa ukwiza, woseni niyo wahitilwa ni ntongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mna chilo gati, niyo kwatenda na lwasu, Sunguzani, sunguzani, msozi eza, hitani mkamhokele! <verse number="7" style="v" />Wandele woseni mlongo niyo wenuka wamalanya taa zawo. <verse number="8" style="v" />Wadya wahezi wawagamba wadya wabala, ‘Chihunguzizeni wavuta wadodo kwaviya taa zetu zafifiya.’ <verse number="9" style="v" />Mna wadya wabala wawahitula, ‘Bule’ ‘hayachinte kwa suwe na nyuwe. Mkadaha hitani kwamaduka, mkagule.’ <verse number="10" style="v" />Ivyo weze waite kokugula, msola niyo eza, wadya wendile ahadya wengila hamwenga no msola kwe nyinka, ulwivi niyo lwavugalwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Vikaheza weza wadya wandele awatuhu, wagamba, ‘Zumbe, zumbe! Chivugwile!’ <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahitula agamba, ‘Nawagambilani chindedi, nyuwe siwamanyize.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yesu akomeleza, “Elo chelezani, kwaviya hammanyize zuwa hegu saa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa wandima watatu</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 19:11-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mwe chipindi icho Useuta wa kwembingu nawikale sa vino. Kwendaga na mntu akunga atambe, awetanga wandima wakwe, aika ugoli wakwe kwawo wamsinyize. <verse number="15" style="v" />Amwinka hela shano, mtuhu hela mbili, mtuhu hela imwenga, chila mntu saviya nguvu ananazo. Niyo atamba. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aho Yudya enkigwe hela shano ahalawa, niyo azidamanyiza mayombe, zamwingiziza ntuhu shano. <verse number="17" style="v" />Seivyo yudya ahokele hela mbili, zamwingiziza ntuhu mbili. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mna yudya enkigwe hela imwenga niyo aita aisimbila hasi, aifisa ihela ya zumbe dyakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Yeze yomboke mazuwa yalozize zumbe dya wadya wandima niyo auya, awauza ivyo wazidamanyize ndima. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eza yudya mndima enkigwe hela shano, enkiza hela shano ntuhu, akagamba, ‘Zumbe, waikaga kwangu hela shano.’ ‘Kaula! Hela shano zongezekele.’ <verse number="21" style="v" />Zumbe dyakwe dya mgamba, ‘N ivyedi, weye mndima ywedi na mchindedi, kutenda mkanuni kwa vijeche, nahutende msinyi ywa vilozize, utende na chinyemi na zumbe dyako!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Yudya mndima enkigwe hela mbili niyo eza, agamba, ‘Zumbe, nakwika hela mbili kwangu. Kaula! Hela mbili zongezekela.’ <verse number="23" style="v" />Zumbe ywakwe amgamba, N ivyedi, mndima ywedi na mchindedi. ‘Kutenda mkanuni kwa vijeche, nahutende msinyi ywa vilozize, ingila utende na chinyemi hamwenga na zumbe dyako!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Niyo eza yudya enkagwa hela imwenga, agamba, ‘Zumbe, nasibunkula kugamba weye wi mdala, weye walozola hwi handile, na kuchisanya hadya hwi mwaganise. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ivyo sogoha, niyo naifisa ihela yako hasi ho msanga. Kaula! Guha ivyako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Niyo Zumbe dyakwe amhitula, “ ‘Weye wi mndima wihiye naho mbwa! Kuvimanya kugamba miye nalozola hantu sihandile nakuchisanya hadya simwaganise mbeyu? <verse number="27" style="v" />Ivyo, naukaungwa wigale hela yangu kwa wadya wakuliha liba, nasiza kuguha ihela yangu na vijenyelekele. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ivyo, hela iyo, mwinkeni yudya mta hela mlongo. <verse number="29" style="v" />Kwaviya chila mta chintu nenkigwe, na kongezezwa vitendese, mna hena, chiya ananacho nacho na ahokwe. <verse number="30" style="v" />Na mndima yudya hekuwagila, mduleni hale kuse kwe chiza, uko nakutenda na ndilo na kusiginta meno.’</para>
  <para style="s">Kanto dyo kukomeleza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Aho Mwana ywa Mntu neze no ukulu wakwe, hamwenga na wandima wa kwembingu wose wakukile nawatende naye, nekale mwe chigoda chakwe cho useuta. <verse number="32" style="v" />Wantu wose mwe zisi zose, na wadugane houso wakwe, naye na awapagule wantu saviya mdimi akupagula ngoto na mbuzi. <verse number="33" style="v" />Naike ngoto ntendele yakwe ya kulume, na mbuzi ntendele ya kumoso. <verse number="34" style="v" />Akaheza Seuta na awagambe wadya wekulume kwakwe, ‘Soni, nyuwe mjimbikwe ni Tate! Hokelani useuta mwikiwe kukongela nkongo mo kuumbwa kwe isi. <verse number="35" style="v" />Nendaga na sala, mninka nkande, nendaga na nchilu mwaninkaga mazi, nendaga mjeni, mwanihokelaga, <verse number="36" style="v" />nani mwazi niyo mwanivisa, nendaga mnyonje, mwezaga kunikaula, nendaga mwedijeleza, mwezaga kunitalamkila.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Wantu wawoneke wedi nawamhitule, Zumbe, ni chipindi chihi chakuwonaga una sala niyo chakwinka nkande, hegu nauna nchilu niyo chakuywesa? <verse number="38" style="v" />Ni ini naho chakuonaga wi mjeni, niyo chakuhokela, hegu wi mwazi niyo chakuvika? <verse number="39" style="v" />Ni ini chakuwonaga wi mnyonje, hegu mwechifungo, niyo cheza kukukaula? <verse number="40" style="v" />Seuta nawahitule, ‘Nawagambilani chindedi, ivyo muwadamanyize wamwe mwa awo walukolo wangu wadodo, mnitendela miye!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Akajika nawagambe wadya we komkono wakwe wa kumoso, ‘Halaweni ho uso wangu, nyuwe mligitwe! Hitani ko moto wa mazuwa yose, ekiwe Mwavu na wandima wakwe! <verse number="42" style="v" />Nendaga nasala, hamninkile nkande, nendaga na nchilu, hamninkile mazi, <verse number="43" style="v" />Nendaga mjeni, hamnihokele, nendaga mwazi, hamnivisize, nendaga mnyonje na mwechifungo, mna hamwizile kunikaula.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Nawamhitule, ‘Zumbe, ni ini chakuonaga una sala hegu nchilu, hegu mjeni, hegu wi mwazi, hegu wi mnyonje, hegu mwechifungo, hachikusankanile?’ <verse number="45" style="v" />Seuta na awahitule, ‘Nawagambilani chindedi, ivyo hemkumtendela yumwenga mwa wano wakuwazwa wadodo, hamnitendele miye.’ <verse number="46" style="v" />Wano nawegalwe kwe kanto dya mazuwa yose, mna wadya wawoneke wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile nawengile mo ujima wa mazuwa yose.”</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ubala wa kumgwila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:1-2; Luka 22:1-2; Yohana 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yesu eze abinde kulonga yoseni ayo, awagamba wanampina wakwe, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mvimanya kugamba, mazuwa maidi yakwiza nakutendeke na Pasaka, na Mwana ywa Mntu nalavigwe chani asulumizwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Niyo wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wadalahala wa wantu wadugana mndani mwe nyumba ya Mlavyantambiko Mkulu, akwitangwa Kayafa, <verse number="4" style="v" />waika ubala, chani wamgwile Yesu chinyele chani wamkome. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mna wagamba, “Vinasekutenda mwe ngasu ye Pasaka, sima kunalaile nkumbizi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahakwa mavuta uko Besani</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:3-9; Yohana 12:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Umo Yesu endaga Besaniya mwe nyumba ya Simoni, akwitangwa mta matana, <verse number="7" style="v" />mvyele mta kasupa ka mavuta yakupwepweleka yakutagwa kwa hela zilozize kamwizila, amjidila mo mtwi wakwe hadya ekale mo kudya he meza. <verse number="8" style="v" />Wanampina wakwe weze wawone, niyo wehiwa, wagamba, “Kwaza kuno ni kwambwani? <verse number="9" style="v" />Mavuta yano nayakadaha kutagwa kwa hela zilozize, niyo wenkigwa wachiwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu niyo abunkula, awagamba, “Nimbwani mwamsunka sunka yuno mvyele? Kanidamanyiza ndima yedi. <verse number="11" style="v" />Wachiwa mnanawo mazuwa yose, mna miye hachitende hamwenga mazuwa yose. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mvyele uyo kanijidila mavuta yakupwepweleka mo mwili wangu chani anike vyedi mo kuhambwa kwangu. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nawagambilani chindedi, kwa chausa cha kumkumbuka yuno mvyele, ntendwa idya adamanye naijendeleze hose Mbuli Yedi nailongwe mwe isi yose.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda azumila kumlavya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:10-11; Luka 22:3-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mwe chipindi icho yumwenga mwa wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi, zina dyakwe Yuda Isikaliyote, awabasa wakulu wa walavyantambiko, <verse number="15" style="v" />awauza, “Namninke chibwani uneva hamwinkiza Yesu kwenyu?” Niyo wamwinka matundu milongo mitatu ya hela. <verse number="16" style="v" />Kukongela aho Yuda naakalonda luhenyo lwa kumwinkiza Yesu kwawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adya nkande ya Pasaka na wanampina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:12-21; Luka 22:7-13, 21-23; Yohana 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zuwa dya nkongo dye Pasaka dye migate heijeligwe Hamila, wanampina wambasa Yesu na kumuza, “Waunga chikutendele hahi Inkande ye pasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba waite ko mzi na kumgambila mntu yumwenga kugamba, “Mhinyi agamba, ‘Zuwa dyangu dihaguhi, miye hamwenga na wanampina wangu nachidye nkande ya Pasaka kwako.’” <verse number="19" style="v" />Wanampina niyo wadamanya enga viya wasigilwe ni Yesu, waikaga nkande ya Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ivyo eze ibule chisingi kekala he nkande hamwenga na wadya mlongo na waidi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Umo nawakadya, Yesu agamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, yumwenga ywenyu nanilavye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Niyo wengilwa ni chinyulu vitendese, wakonga kumuza yumwe yumwe, “Zumbe, ni miye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahitula agamba, “Natweze tonge dyakwe hamwenga na miye mwe bakuli nuyo akunga anilavye. <verse number="24" style="v" />Mwana ywa Mntu aita zakwe enga ivyo awandikilwe mwa Mawandiko ya Kukile. Mna hangi mwenye yudya mntu akunga amlavye! Nani vyedi mntu yudya hegu helekagwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Yuda, yudya mta kumlavya, amhitula, agamba, “Mhinyi, ni miye?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula, “Weye kulonga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nkande ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:22-26; Luka 22:14-20; 1Wakolinto 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Umo wendile wakadya, Yesu niyo aguha mgate, aujimbika, niyo aubesula, awenka wanampina wakwe akagamba, “Guhani mdye. Uno nuwo mwili wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Akaheza aguha chikombe, amtogola Chohile, na kuwenka. Akagamba, “Nywani nyoseni,” <verse number="28" style="v" />“Ino niyo sakame yangu ya lagano, ikwitika kwachausa cha walozize chani walekeilwe masa yawo. <verse number="29" style="v" />Mna nawagambilani, saninywe naho kukongela haluse lweleko luno lwo mzabibu, kubula hadya nanizile kunywa impya hamwenga na nyuwe mo Useuta wa Tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Weze wabinde ukuchema, walawa kolwazo kwita ko Lugulu lwa Mizeituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alotela ukulemelwa ni Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:27-31; Luka 22:31-34; Yohana 13:36-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Naho Yesu akuwagamba, “Chilo cha dyelo, nyuwe nyose namwihizwe kwa chausa changu. Kwaviya viwandikwa, Chohile agamba, ‘Nanimtowe umdimi, ne idifyo dye zingoto nadimwagikane.’ <verse number="32" style="v" />Mna heza kuuyuka, naniwalongweleni kwita Galilaya.” <verse number="33" style="v" />Petulo ahitula, amgamba, “Wose wanakwasa, miye sahwase!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Chindedi nakugambila, weye chilo chino umo zogolo hadinati kwila, naunilemele nkanana ntatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Petulo amgamba, “Uneva vyaungwa nibanike hamwenga naweye navihaya mna sahulemele ng'o.”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wanampina wose walonga seivyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amlombeza Chohile uko Gesemane</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:32-42; Luka 22:39-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Akaheza, Yesu aita hamwenga na wanampina wakwe hantu hakwitangwa Gesemane, awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Ikalani hano, nite halombeze.” <verse number="37" style="v" />Amguha Petulo na wadya wana waidi wa Zebedayo, akonga kwingilwa ni usungu na tumbwaziko. <verse number="38" style="v" />Naho awagambila, “Nina usungu vidala mo moyo haguhi na kubanika. Ikalani hano, mcheleze hamwenga na miye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ajendeleza kulongozi hadodo, agwa chifudifudi, alombeza, agamba, “Tati yangu, vikadahika, champa chino chikombe, mna visekutenda enga viya hunga miye, mna saviya ukunga weye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Awezila wadya wanampina, awabwila wagona. Amgamba Petulo, “Togola! Hamdahile kucheleza na miye kubula saa dimwenga? <verse number="41" style="v" />Chelezani, mlombeze, msekwiza kwingila mwe majezo, Muye wa mntu waunga kudamanya vyedi mna mwili uhwa.” <verse number="42" style="v" />Aita nkanana ya kaidi, alombeza, agamba, “Tati yangu, uneva havikudahika ichikombe chino cha masulumizo chinenege uneva sinywele, mna ivyo ukunga vitendeke.” <verse number="43" style="v" />Eza vituhu, awabwila wagona, kwaviya meso yawo yazamilwa ni ntongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Awasa vituhu, aita, alombeza nkanana ya katatu, alonga mbuli iziya. <verse number="45" style="v" />Akaheza awezila wanampina wakwe, awagamba, “Mchei gonile? Kaulani, chipindi chibula Mwana ywa Mntu nalavywe mwe mikono ya wantu wata masa. <verse number="46" style="v" />Inukani, chiteni zetu! Kaulani, yudya akunga anihituke ehaguhi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kugwilwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:43-50; Luka 22:47-53; Yohana 18:3-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Umo achei kulonga, Yuda, yumwe wa wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi niyo eza hamwenga na fyo kulu dya wata mabamba na malungu. Nawasigilwa ni wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wadalahala wa wantu. <verse number="48" style="v" />Yuda, yudya akumhituka nakawenka chilagiso, akagamba, “Mntu uyo hunga kumsesa, uyo nuyo. Mgwileni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Aho amsogeila Yesu, amlamsa, “Ndamsa Mhinyi!” Niyo amsesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Yesu amgamba, “Mbwiyangu, damanya idyo ubasize.”</para>
  <para style="p">Waita, wamgwila Yesu. <verse number="51" style="v" />Yumwenga mwe wadya na we hamwenga na Yesu achumiza umkono wakwe, asomola idibamba dyakwe, amtowa mndima ywa mlavyantambiko mkulu, amsenga idigutwi. <verse number="52" style="v" />Aho Yesu amgamba, “Vuza idibamba dyako mwe yala yakwe. Wose nawatoze bamba, nawakomwe kwa bamba. <verse number="53" style="v" />Hegu hamanyize kugamba nadaha kumlombeza tate, naye adaha kunigaila wankondo wa bunga dya kwembingu kujinka mlongo na maidi ya wandima wa kwembingu? <verse number="54" style="v" />Ivyo nayachinte vivihi Mawandiko Yakukile yakugamba nivyo vikungwa vitendeke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ichipindi icho Yesu niyo alugambila ludya ulukudidi lwa wantu wezile kumgwila, “Togolani, mlawa enga kwiza kumgwila mpolaganyi wata mabamba na malungu chani mnitoze? Chila zuwa nani mwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile hahinya, mna hamnigwile. <verse number="56" style="v" />Mna yano yose yalaila, chani mawandiko ya wawoni yachinte.”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wanampina wose wamwasa, wanyilika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kwechitala</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:53-65; Luka 22:54-55, 63-71; Yohana 18:13-14, 19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Wadya wamgwile Yesu niyo wamwigala kwa Mlavyantambiko Mkulu akwitangwa Kayafa, hantu wahinya Sigilizi na wadalahala wendile wadugana. <verse number="58" style="v" />Petulo nakamtimila kwa luhalehale kubula kungwelo kwa Mlavyantambiko Mkulu, engila kunyumba hamwenga na wambizi chani adahe kuziwona mbuli zose zikunga zilaile. <verse number="59" style="v" />Ivyo wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wadya wose we chitala walonda mbuli za udanti kulawana na Yesu, chani wamkome. <verse number="60" style="v" />Mna hawabunkule ulosi wowose, hamwenga na ivyo wantu walozize naweza wamlongeile udanti. Nkomelezo weza waukuzi waidi, <verse number="61" style="v" />wagamba, “Yuno nakagamba, ‘Nadaha kuivuna Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, na kuizenga naho kwa mazuwa matatu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Mlavyantambiko Mkulu achimala amgamba Yesu, “Nimbwani hukuhitula mbuli? Wano walonga vikukulanga weye?” <verse number="63" style="v" />Mna, Yesu kanyamala dwi. Mlavyantambiko Mkulu amgamba, “Kwelise kwa zina dya Chohile mta ujima, chigambile hegu weye nuyo Kulisito Mkombola, Mwana ywa Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Yesu amhitula, “Heye, ni saivyo ukulonga. Mna nawagambilani, kukongela haluse nammuwone Mwana ywa Mntu kekala ntendele ya kulume kwa Chohile mta nguvu zose, akeza kulanga kwa maingu ya kwembingu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Niyo Mlavyantambiko Mkulu atatula izisuche zakwe na kugamba, “Mntu yuno kahuluta! Chaungilani vituhu ukuzi mwakwe? Kaulani, mwiva ivyo ahulute. <verse number="66" style="v" />Nyuwe mwafanyanya vihi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wahitula, “Ana masa aungwa akomwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Niyo wamtwela mate mo uso, wamtowa. Watuhu wamtowa maihi, <verse number="68" style="v" />wakagamba, “Elo, Kulisito Mkombola, lavya uwoni, ni yuhi akutoile!”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amlemela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 14:66-72; Luka 22:56-62; Yohana 18:15-18, 25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Petulo nakekala kweise kouwa. Mndima yumwenga wa chivyele ambasa, agamba, “Weye nawe na wihamwenga na Yesu ywa Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Mna kalemela mwa meso ya wose, akahitula, “Simanyize idyo ukulonga.” <verse number="71" style="v" />Umo akafosa ko lwivi, mndima mtuhu ywa chivyele kamwona, niyo awagambila wadya wantu nawehadya, “Mntu yuno nehamwenga na Yesu ywa Nazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Petulo alemela vituhu kwa kwelisa, “Simmanyize mntu yuno!” <verse number="73" style="v" />Weze wekale hadodo, wantu na wehadya niyo wambasa Petulo, wamgamba, “Chindedi, weye nawe na wi yumwenga wawo, kwaviya milongele yako yalagisa kulaila Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Niyo Petulo agamba, “Chohile kamanya nalonga chindedi, neligita na kwelisa uneva nalonga udanti, simmanyize uyo mntu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Ahadya zogolo niyo dyaila. <verse number="75" style="v" />Petulo akumbuka mbuli idya agambilwe ni Yesu, “Umo zogolo hadinati kwila, naunilemele nkanana ntatu,” Ivyo afosa kweise, niyo aila vidala.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 15:1; Luka 23:1-2; Yohana 18:28-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kwize kuche, wakulu wa walavyantambiko wakulu wose na wadalahala wa wantu wadamanya ulosi kulanga Yesu chani wamkome. <verse number="2" style="v" />Wamtaliza minyolo, wamguha na kumwigala kwa Pilato, asagulwe ni Mkulu ywa Lumi.</para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">Ntendwa 1:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Umo Yuda, yudya amhituke, eze awone kugamba wamkantila kale Yesu, niyo awona usungu mo moyo, avuza yadya amatundu milongo mitatu, kwa wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wadalahala. <verse number="4" style="v" />Agamba, “Sidamanya wavu kumlavya mntu hena masa akomwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna wowo wagamba, “Idyo suwe hadimwetu idyo naumanye mweye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Niyo azidula ziya izihela Kwenyumba nkulu ya Chohile, ahalawa aita akwenyulika,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Wakulu wa walavyantambiko waziguha ziya izihela, wagamba, “Sivyo vyedi mwe sigilizi yetu kuzijela izihela zino mwe shanduku dye Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, kwaviya ni hela ya sakame.” <verse number="7" style="v" />Niyo walosana wevana wagule nkonde ya mufi watenda hantu hakuzikila wajeni. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ivyo nivyo vikuleka kubula dyelo nkonde iyo yetangwa Nkonde ya Sakame.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nivyo ichintile mbuli ya ulosi ulongigwe ni muwoni Yelemiya, akagamba, “Nawaguha vihande milongo mitatu ya hela, nayo maliho ya wantu wa Izulaeli wazumilaga kumliha, <verse number="10" style="v" />na wazigwila nkonde ya mufi, enga viya Zumbe anisigilaga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pilato amuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 15:2-5; Luka 23:3-5; Yohana 18:33-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Yesu nakachimaliswa houso wa Pilato, mkulu ywa mkowa, ivyo mkulu wa mkowa amuza, “Weye nuyo seuta ywa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula, “Walonga weye,” <verse number="12" style="v" />Mna wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wadalahala weze wamlongele hahitule mbuli yoyose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ivyo Pilato amuza, “Vino hukwiva izimbuli izo zose wakukulongela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mna Yesu hahitule hata mbuli imwenga, itenda mkulu ywa mkowa ehelwe vidala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akantilwa kukomwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 15:6-15; Luka 23:13-25; Yohana 18:39, 19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nawazwela mwe Ngasu ya Pasaka Mkulu ywa Chilumi awalekeila Wayahudi mfugwa yumwenga wakumunga. <verse number="16" style="v" />Mwe ichipindi icho nakuna mfungwa amanyike vidala, zina dyakwe nuyo Balaba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ivyo wantu weze wadugane hamwenga, Pilato niyo awauza, “Mwaunga ni walekeile yuhi mwa wano waidi, Balaba hegu Yesu akwitangwa Kulisito Mkombola?” <verse number="18" style="v" />Kwaviya na kamanya kugamba na wamlavya Yesu kwa chausa cha finju.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Umo Pilato ekale mwe chigoda che nkanto, mkaziwe amwigailaga ulosi kugamba, “Usekutenda na mbuli na yuno awoneke ni ywedi, kwaviya dyelo siwonesa vidala mwe sozi, kwachausa chakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mna wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wadalahala waluvya idifyo dya wantu waunge alekelwe Balaba, Yesu akomwe. <verse number="21" style="v" />Mna Pilato auza idifyo, “Ni yuhi mwa wano waidi mkunga ni walekeile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wahitula, “Balaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilato awauza, “Haluse nimtende mbwani Yesu akwitangwa Kulisito Mkombola?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wose wagamba, “Asulumizwe mo msalaba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mna Pilato auza, “Ni mbwani?” Kakola masa yani?</para>
  <para style="p">Waguta vidala, “Asulumizwe mo msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Umo Pilato eze amanye hamna dyodyose, dikujenda naho nkumbizi nazikakonga, niyo aguha mazi, ahaka mwe mikono yakwe mwa meso ye idifyo dya wantu, agamba, “Miye simuli mwe file ya yuno mntu, nammanye wenye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Wantu wose wahitula wagamba, “Sakame yakwe itende mlanga mwetu hamwenga na wenetu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Niyo Pilato awalekeila Balaba. Eze aheze kumunga Yesu ahutwe nkome, amlavya chani asulumizwe mo msalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Wankondo Wambela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 15:16-20; Yohana 19:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Niyo wankondo wa Pilato wamwingiza Yesu mwe nkambi ya wankondo wa Chilumi, niyo woseni wamzunguluka. <verse number="28" style="v" />Wamvula izisuche zakwe, wamvisa suche ya Chiseuta. <verse number="29" style="v" />Niyo waluka chilemba cha miwa, wamvisa mo mtwi, ko mkono wakwe wakulume, wamwikiya tete. Wamfikila madi ho uso wakwe, wamtila wakagamba, “Ndamsa Seuta ywa Wayahudi!” <verse number="30" style="v" />Wamtwela mate, waguha diya iditete, wamhuta huta nadyo ko mtwi. <verse number="31" style="v" />Weze wabinde kumtila, niyo wamvula idya isuche ye Chiseuta, wamvika suche zakwe, wamwigala ko kumsulumiza mo msalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atungikwa mo msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 15:21-32; Luka 23:26-43; Yohana 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Umo wakaita, wabwila mntu yumwenga Mkilene zina dyakwe nuyo Simoni, mwikazi ywa Kilene, wamhimbiliza enule msalaba wa Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v" />Niyo wabula hantu hakwitangwa Goligota, nuko kugamba, “Hantu ha Ngobela ya mtwi.” <verse number="34" style="v" />Wamnywesa divai ihangaywe na chintu chisungu, mna Yesu eze alume, alemela kuinywa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Weze waheze kumsulumiza, niyo wasangilana suche za Yesu kwa kuzitoila tegatega. <verse number="36" style="v" />Niyo wekala wamdima. <verse number="37" style="v" />Halanga ho mtwi wakwe mo msalaba waika wandiko kukantilwa kwakwe, viwandikwa, “Yuno nuyo Yesu, Seuta ywa Wayahudi.” <verse number="38" style="v" />Wapolaganyi waidi niyo wasulumizwa hajihi na Yesu mwe misalaba yawo, yumwenga ntendele ya kumoso mtuhu kulume.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Wantu wendile wakajinka hantu aho wamhuluta, wakasingisa singisa imitwi yawo, wakagamba, <verse number="40" style="v" />“Weye ukudaha kutula Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile na kuizenga kwa mazuwa matatu, haluse kwehonye mwenye. Hegu weye wi Mwana ywa Chohile, sela mo msalaba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Seivyo na wakulu wa walavyantambiko hamwenga na wahinya Sigilizi na wadalahala na wamtila wakagamba, <verse number="42" style="v" />“Kahonya watuhu, mna hakudaha kwehonya mwenye, hambwe yeye ni seuta ywa Waizulaeli, hegu ni chindedi na asele haluse mo msalaba naswi nachimzumile. <verse number="43" style="v" />Nakamwegamila Chohile na kugamba hambwe ni Mwana ywa Chohile, haluse Chohile na mwambule hegu amunga.” <verse number="44" style="v" />Seivyo wadya wapolaganyi wasulumizwe mo msalaba hamwenga nauyo wamhuluta.</para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 15:33-41; Luka 23:44-49; Yohana 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kukongela sa mtandatu nomsi, chiza nachigubika isi yose vibindile ma sa matatu. <verse number="46" style="v" />Ize ibule mwe sa chenda ya chisingi, Yesu niyo aila kwa izwi kulu, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakisani?” Nuko kugamba, “Chohile, Chohile, nimbwani kunasa?” <verse number="47" style="v" />Umo wadya wachimale hadya weze weve ivyo niyo wagamba, “Amwitanga Eliya!” <verse number="48" style="v" />Yumwenga ywawo aguluka aguha lendele, aditweza mwe siki, aika mlanga mwe tete niyo amwinka anywe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Watuhu wagamba, “Leka, chikaule hegu Eliya neze amwambule!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Yesu naho agututisa na kuhema muye wa nkomelezo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aho paziya dye Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile dyatatuka hagati, kukongela kulanga kubula hasi. Si niyo yengilwa nichisingisa, mayuwe makulu yatulika. <verse number="52" style="v" />Mbila zagubuka, na wantu wa Chohile walozize wabanikaga chikale wauyuswa. <verse number="53" style="v" />Weze wauyuke mwe zimbila zawo, naho Yesu eze auyuke niyo wengila Yelusalemu mo mzi Ukukile, wantu walozize wawawona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ivyo yudya mkulu ywa wankondo, na wadya wendile wehamwenga nauyo wakamdima Yesu, weze wawone ichisingisa cheisi na mbuli zilaile, wogoha vidala, wagamba, “Chindedi mntu yuno nani Mwana Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hantu aho hendaga na wavyele walozize wakasinya luhale hale, awo niwadya wamtimile Yesu kukongela Galilaya, wakamsankanila. <verse number="56" style="v" />Mgati mwawo endaga Maliyamu Magidalena, Maliyamu mami yawo dya Yakobo na Yusufu, hamwenga na mami yawo wana wa Zebedayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mazisi ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 15:42-47; Luka 23:50-56; Yohana 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ize ibule chisingi, eza mgoli yumwenga mntu ywa Alimataya, zina dyakwe nuyo Yusufu, endaga mwanampina ywa Yesu. <verse number="58" style="v" />Amwitila Pilato akalombeza enkigwe umwili wa Yesu. Ivyo Pilato azumila enkigwe. <verse number="59" style="v" />Yusufu aguha udya umwili wa Yesu, auvisa sanda ikukile, <verse number="60" style="v" />awika mndani mwe mbila yakwe asongolaga mwe luwe. Niyo afingilisa yuwe kulu divugala ulwivi lwe mbila, niyo ahalawa. <verse number="61" style="v" />Maliyamu Magidalena, na yudya Maliyamu mtuhu nawekala wakakaula kwe mbila.</para>
  <para style="s">Wamizi we mbila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Zuwa dikutimila nani zuwa dya Kuhumula, wakulu wa walavyantambiko na Mafalisayo nawambasa Pilato, <verse number="63" style="v" />wagamba, “Zumbe, chakumbuka kugamba yudya mdanti nakagamba umo endaga mjima, ‘Yanabula mazuwa matatu naniuyuke.’ <verse number="64" style="v" />Ivyo sigila imbila idimwe dibule zuwa dya katatu chani wanampina wakwe wanase kumbawa na kuwagamba wantu kugamba kauyuka. Udanti uno we nkomelezo nautende wiha vidala kujinka udya wankongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Pilato awagamba, “Hayani, mkamile imbila sevyo na mmanye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ivyo niyo waita, wayamila imbila, wakanda hula mwe diya idiyuwe hamwenga na wadya wankondo waidi.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Uuyuko</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 16:1-10; Luka 24:1-12; Yohana 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dize dijinke zuwa dya Kuhumula, luvi dyakwe zuwa dya nkongo dya juma, Maliyamu Magidalena na yudya Maliyamu mtuhu waita wakukaula imbila. <verse number="2" style="v" />Chipumpa kulaila chisingisa chikulu mwe isi, kwaviya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe kasela kulaila kwembingu, kafingilisa diya diyuwe digubike imbila kunkanda nakudikaila. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nakekala enga lumwemwe na suche zakwe na zikang'ala chwee. <verse number="4" style="v" />Vikaheza wadya wamizi we mbila wogohesa na kuzingiza, wekala saviya wabanike.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Yudya mndima ywa kwembingu ahitula, awagamba wadya wavyele, “Msekogoha, kwaviya sivimanya kugamba mwamlonda Yesu, yudya atungikwe. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahali hano, kauyuka, saviya alongaga. Soni mkaule hantu hadya wamwikaga. <verse number="7" style="v" />Sunguzani mwite haluse, mka wagambile wanampina wakwe, ‘Kauyuka mwe wabanike, naho awalongwela kwita Galilaya, nuko na mumuwone!’ Elo siwagambilani kale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Wanyaguliza kuhalawa he mbila, wakogohesa naho wengilwa ni chinyemi chikulu. Waguluka kuwagambila wanampina wakwe mbuli idya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aho Yesu adugana na wadya wavyele na kuwalamsa, awagamba, “Ahoni.” Wamsogeila wamfikila madi, wamvikila. <verse number="10" style="v" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Msekogoha, hitani mkawagambile walukolo wangu waite Galilaya, nauko nuko wakunga waniwone.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya wamizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Wadya nawo umo wakaita, wankondo watuhu niyo wengila mo mzi, wawagambila wakulu wa walavyantambiko zimbuli zose zilaile. <verse number="12" style="v" />Wadugana hamwenga na wadalahala, walosana, wawenka wankondo hela zilozize, <verse number="13" style="v" />wakagamba, “Gambani, kugamba wanampina wakwe weza neichilo niyo wabawa umwili wakwe umo suwe chigonile. <verse number="14" style="v" />Uneva liwali aneva imbuli ino, suwe nachilosane naye chani mnase kwingila mwe nkumbizi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ivyo waziguha ziya zihela, wadamanya saviya wagambilwe. Imbuli iyo ijendeleza mwa Wayahudi kubula vino dyelo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanampina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mako 16:14-18; Luka 24:36-49; Yohana 20:19-23; Matayo 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Wadya wanampina mlongo na imwenga niyo waita Galilaya kubula ko lugulu ludya wasigilwe ni Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v" />Weze wamwone, wamfikila madi, mna watuhu mgati mwawo na wana nkama. <verse number="18" style="v" />Akaheza Yesu niyo awasogeila, na awagamba, “Sinkigwa udahi wose wa kwembingu na mwe isi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Elo, hitani, mkawatende wantu wose we isi watende wanampina wangu, mkawabatiza kwa zina dya Tate, na Mwana na Muye Ukukile. <verse number="20" style="v" />Muwahinye kutoza amalagiso yose niwenkileni. Naho mmanye kugamba miye nihamwenga nanyuwe mazuwa yose kubula ko udumo we isi.”</para>
</usx>